@prefix :      <https://thesis.local/kg/portfolio#> .
@prefix owl:   <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdf:   <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs:  <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix xsd:   <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
@prefix skos:  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> .

#################################################################
# Portfolio Knowledge Graph — TBox (schema only)
#
# Loads into named graph urn:graph:tbox (see schema/README.md).
# Companion files: shapes.ttl (SHACL constraints), reference.ttl
# (GICS taxonomy + asset master data, urn:graph:reference),
# rules.ttl (veto catalog instance data, urn:graph:rules:catalog),
# instances.trig (dated ABox, multiple named graphs).
#
# Source lineage: formalizes "Avance arquitectura del sistema.docx"
# (v1, §§1-6) plus critique-and-evolution.md's fixes (cited inline
# as "critique #N"). This file supersedes the earlier single-file
# schema/portfolio-kg.ttl, split here into a proper multi-file
# layout per 07-ontology-topology.md's named-graph design.
#################################################################

:
    a owl:Ontology ;
    rdfs:label "Portfolio Knowledge Graph Ontology — TBox" ;
    rdfs:comment "Ontology for a temporal, audit-traceable knowledge graph backing an S&P 500 portfolio construction/maintenance system." ;
    rdfs:comment "2026-08-23: added a class taxonomy (section 1.2) over the 24 disjoint leaf classes below, and upgraded EvidenceSource/RuleOperand/ObservationSnapshot from owl:unionOf helpers to ordinary rdfs:subClassOf superclasses (same IRIs) -- see 06-ontology-definition.md §1.2. No existing class, property, cardinality restriction, or SHACL shape changed." ;
    owl:versionInfo "0.4.0-thesis-implementation" .

#################################################################
# 1. CORE CLASSES
#################################################################

:Asset
    a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Asset" ;
    rdfs:label "activo"@es ;
    skos:definition "Línea cotizada que sigue el sistema, identificada por su símbolo más reciente: normalmente una acción del S&P 500, o un ETF núcleo. Una empresa que cambia de símbolo es un solo nodo con todas sus pertenencias (por ejemplo, FB→META); una empresa con varias clases de acciones en el índice tiene un nodo por clase (GOOGL y GOOG, FOXA y FOX, NWSA y NWS). Un símbolo reutilizado por otra empresa conserva el nodo de la era que se carga; si dos CIK cargados reclaman el mismo símbolo más reciente, la carga se detiene."@es ;
    rdfs:comment "A publicly traded company line or core ETF tracked by the system (v1 §2A, §3A). An ordinary Asset is an S&P 500 constituent; an ExchangeTradedFund is the core position and has no membership or GICS classification." .

:ExchangeTradedFund
    a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:subClassOf :Asset ;
    rdfs:label "Exchange-Traded Fund" ;
    rdfs:label "ETF núcleo"@es ;
    skos:definition "Fondo cotizado que el sistema mantiene como núcleo de la cartera (por ejemplo, SPY). No es una acción del S&P 500: no tiene CIK, pertenencia al índice ni clasificación sectorial GICS, y las consultas de sector lo muestran como «ETF núcleo», nunca como «sin sector»."@es ;
    rdfs:comment "Work item 33: a listed fund held as the book's core (SPY). It is an Asset, but not an S&P 500 constituent: no CIK, no UniverseMembership and no GICS classification. Its reader-facing Spanish label is 'ETF núcleo', so a sector query reports it explicitly instead of counting it as unclassified. No FIBO rdfs:seeAlso: the pinned 2026Q2 slice (schema/fibo.ttl, schema/fibo_terms.csv) has no exchange-traded-fund term, and no IRI is invented." .

:Sector
    a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:subClassOf skos:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Sector" ;
    rdfs:label "sector"@es ;
    skos:definition "Sector de la clasificación GICS (por ejemplo, «tecnología de la información»)."@es ;
    rdfs:comment "GICS-level sector concept (e.g. 'Information Technology'). Closes critique #3 (no sector layer)." ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/SEC/Securities/SecuritiesClassification/GlobalIndustryClassificationStandardsClassifier> .

:Industry
    a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:subClassOf skos:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Industry" ;
    rdfs:label "industria"@es ;
    skos:definition "Grupo de industria de la clasificación GICS. Coincide con los 25 grupos de GICS, salvo Energía, que el grafo divide en sus dos industrias: equipos y servicios de energía, y petróleo, gas y combustibles consumibles."@es ;
    rdfs:comment "GICS-level industry-group concept, rolls up to exactly one Sector via memberOfSector. Closes critique #3." ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/FND/Arrangements/ClassificationSchemes/IndustrySectorClassifier> .

:Universe
    a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Universe" ;
    rdfs:label "universo"@es ;
    skos:definition "Conjunto de activos entre los que el sistema puede elegir; en esta tesis, los miembros del S&P 500 vigentes en cada fecha. No es la referencia contra la que se mide el desempeño."@es ;
    rdfs:comment "A named candidate pool (e.g. the quarterly Watchlist) that Assets belong to via UniverseMembership (v1 §2A)." .

:UniverseMembership
    a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Universe Membership" ;
    rdfs:label "pertenencia al universo"@es ;
    skos:definition "Pertenencia de un activo al universo durante el intervalo inclusivo [validFrom, validTo]; validTo es el último día de pertenencia y, si falta, sigue vigente."@es ;
    rdfs:comment "N-ary relation reifying v1's (Asset)-[PERTENECE_A_UNIVERSO{fecha_inicio,fecha_fin}]->(Universe) edge as a first-class individual. validTo is INCLUSIVE (the last day of membership, upstream's valid_to); a one-day stint has validFrom == validTo. validTo absent/unbound == still active (mirrors v1's fecha_fin=NULL)." .

:ScoreSnapshot
    a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Score Snapshot" ;
    rdfs:label "instantánea de puntuación"@es ;
    skos:definition "Observación inmutable y con marca de tiempo, registrada por un agente especializado; nunca se actualiza en el mismo individuo."@es ;
    rdfs:comment "Immutable, timestamped observation persisted by one specialist agent (v1 §3A). Never updated in place." .

:RiskEvent
    a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Risk Event" ;
    rdfs:label "evento de riesgo"@es ;
    skos:definition "Evento discreto señalado (legal, financiero, de mercado o de red) que puede desencadenar un veto y que siempre está respaldado por al menos una fuente de evidencia."@es ;
    rdfs:comment "A discrete flagged event (legal, financial, market, network) that can trigger a Veto, always backed by >=1 evidence item (v1 §3B; SHACL-enforced, closes critique #5)." .

:NewsArticle
    a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "News Article" ;
    rdfs:label "artículo de noticias"@es ;
    skos:definition "Fuente de evidencia: un artículo de noticias que respalda un evento de riesgo. El identificador de procedencia (provenanceId) lo vincula con el pipeline de recolección y rastreo de noticias."@es ;
    rdfs:comment "Evidence leaf: a news article backing a RiskEvent. provenanceId cross-references the existing news-collector/news-crawler SQLite pipeline." .

:SECFiling
    a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "SEC Filing" ;
    rdfs:label "documento presentado ante la SEC"@es ;
    skos:definition "Documento individual presentado ante la SEC a través de EDGAR (10-K, 10-Q, 8-K o DEF 14A) para un activo."@es ;
    rdfs:comment "A single document filed with the SEC through EDGAR (10-K, 10-Q, 8-K, DEF 14A) for one Asset." ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/FND/Arrangements/Reporting/Report> .

:SECFilingSection
    a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "SEC Filing Section" ;
    rdfs:label "sección del documento presentado ante la SEC"@es ;
    skos:definition "Fuente de evidencia: una sección extraída de un documento presentado ante la SEC (por ejemplo, el punto 1A, el punto 3 o la lista de directores del DEF 14A). Puede ser reemplazada por una sección corregida posterior."@es ;
    rdfs:comment "Evidence leaf: an extracted section of a document filed with the SEC (Item 1A, Item 3, DEF 14A director list — v1 §2B). May be supersededBy a later corrected section (restatement — closes critique #8, see 07-ontology-topology.md)." .

:DataQualityIssue
    a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Data Quality Issue" ;
    rdfs:label "problema de calidad de datos"@es ;
    skos:definition "Fuente de evidencia: una activación de una verificación DQ_* de la primera ronda (fila data_quality_issue del sistema de origen, dq-v2) sobre los datos de una declaración de un activo. Una métrica bloqueada se lee como NULL en el sistema de origen. Un problema HARD es el que cita el veto DATA_QUALITY: un evento de riesgo lo respalda o la regla del veto evalúa el predicado HasHardDataQualityIssue sobre él."@es ;
    rdfs:comment "Evidence leaf (T-104): one Ring-1 DQ_* gate firing (upstream's data_quality_issue row, dq-v2) on an asset's filing data. A quarantined gated metric reads as NULL upstream. A HARD issue is what the DATA_QUALITY veto cites: a RiskEvent is backedBy it, or the veto's rule evaluates the HasHardDataQualityIssue predicate over it." .

:Executive
    a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Executive" ;
    rdfs:label "directivo o miembro de la junta directiva"@es ;
    skos:definition "Director (miembro de la junta directiva) o directivo de una empresa, nombrado en su declaración de representación (proxy, DEF 14A). Lo usa la regla de contagio VETO_RED_01."@es ;
    rdfs:comment "A named director/officer extracted from DEF 14A filings, used by the VETO_RED_01 contagion rule (v1 §4). canonicalId is populated by the entity-resolution service (roadmap step 7)." .

:AssetCoOccurrence
    a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Asset Co-occurrence" ;
    rdfs:label "coocurrencia de activos"@es ;
    skos:definition "Vínculo candidato, ponderado y versionado por método, entre dos activos, derivado de su coocurrencia en noticias. Está reificado porque el vínculo transporta método y peso; no es un vínculo verificado de dirección compartida y nunca implica sharedExecutiveWith."@es ;
    rdfs:comment "T-107 (D10): one method-versioned, weighted CANDIDATE link between two assets derived from news co-occurrence (upstream shared_executive_edge, method news-per-cooccurrence-v1; or the media_cooccurrence table once populated). Reified because the link carries method/weight. It is NOT a verified shared directorship and never implies :sharedExecutiveWith." .

:BenchmarkObservation
    a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Benchmark Observation" ;
    rdfs:label "observación de referencia"@es ;
    skos:definition "Un número terminado que el módulo cuantitativo del sistema de origen calculó sobre un portafolio: una métrica de desempeño de un libro de referencia o un peso activo por activo frente al libro vivo. Se proyecta tal como se recibe, nunca se calcula aquí; los retornos, mu y Sigma no se proyectan."@es ;
    rdfs:comment "T-108 (D11): one finished number that upstream's quant module computed about a Portfolio -- a benchmark book's performance metric (v_quant_benchmark_performance) or a per-asset active weight against the live book (v_quant_vs_live, with quantAsset). Projected as handed over, never computed here; returns, mu and Sigma are not projected." .

:Veto
    a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Veto"@en ;
    rdfs:label "veto"@es ;
    skos:definition "Nodo de decisión del orquestador para un activo: qué regla o reglas se activaron y por qué. Desde T-102, un veto es un período (raisedOn..clearedOn, filas de veto del sistema de origen), no un evento de un solo ciclo."@es  .

:RuleDefinition
    a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Rule Definition" ;
    rdfs:label "definición de regla"@es ;
    skos:definition "Regla versionada del catálogo, válida durante [validFrom, validTo): puede ser una regla de selección, cuya activación da lugar a un veto, o una regla de protección diaria GUARD, que no es una regla de veto. Se almacena como datos del grafo, no como código de la aplicación."@es ;
    rdfs:comment "A versioned catalog rule, valid over [validFrom, validTo): either a selection rule, whose firing can raise a veto, or a GUARD protection rule, which is not a veto rule. Stored as graph data, not application code (closes critique #6)." .

:RuleClause
    a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Rule Clause" ;
    rdfs:label "cláusula de regla"@es ;
    skos:definition "Nodo AND/OR del árbol de expresión booleana de una definición de regla. Sustituye la cadena infija sin paréntesis de v1 por un árbol explícito."@es ;
    rdfs:comment "One AND/OR node in a RuleDefinition's boolean expression tree. Replaces v1's unparenthesized infix string (source of critique #1's precedence bug) with an explicit tree." .

:ThresholdComparison
    a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Threshold Comparison" ;
    rdfs:label "comparación de umbral"@es ;
    skos:definition "Operando hoja de una cláusula de regla: una terna numérica de métrica, operador y umbral, por ejemplo (ScoreFinanciero, '>', 0.65). La comparación usa normalizedScore para las métricas Score* y rawValue para Sentiment, SectorRelativeMomentum y las métricas del sistema de origen que no son tipos de ScoreSnapshot."@es ;
    rdfs:comment "A leaf RuleClause operand: one numeric metric/operator/threshold triple, e.g. (ScoreFinanciero, '>', 0.65). CONVENTION (found while populating instances.trig, not stated in 06-ontology-definition.md): the Orchestrator's tree-walker compares Score* metrics (ScoreFinanciero/ScoreTecnico/ScoreCuantitativo) against ScoreSnapshot.normalizedScore ([0.0,1.0], matches v1's 0.65-0.90 thresholds), but compares the Sentiment metric against ScoreSnapshot.rawValue ([-1.0,1.0], matches v1's -0.50/-0.60 thresholds, which are out of range on the normalized scale). This per-metric dispatch has to be hardcoded in the evaluator; it is not derivable from the ontology alone. Added 2026-08-13: SectorRelativeMomentum (a ScoreSnapshot metricType, not a new class) is a third entry in this same dispatch table, compared via rawValue like Sentiment -- see rules.ttl's VETO_MKT_02. Added 2026-10-03 (T-103): upstream's catalog uses metrics that are not ScoreSnapshot types (leverage.debt_to_equity, cashflow.free_cash_flow_margin, liquidity.current_ratio — fundamental ratios; max_drawdown_90d — a price-derived metric computed upstream, not a :PriceObservation property; fundamental_score_age_days — derived). They carry upstream's own identifiers and compare against the metric's raw value; there is no normalizedScore for them." .

:CategoricalComparison
    a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Categorical Comparison" ;
    rdfs:label "comparación categórica"@es ;
    skos:definition "Operando hoja de una cláusula de regla que compara un campo categórico (por ejemplo, RiskEvent.category o RiskEvent.severity) con un valor de texto esperado mediante igualdad."@es ;
    rdfs:comment "A leaf RuleClause operand comparing a categorical field (e.g. RiskEvent.category, RiskEvent.severity) against an expected string value via equality. DISCOVERED DURING IMPLEMENTATION: the original ThresholdComparison-only design (06-ontology-definition.md §1.5) covers the numeric confluent rules but not VETO_LEG_01/VETO_COMP_02, which gate on RiskEvent.category/severity, not a numeric ScoreSnapshot metric — this class fills that gap. See rules.ttl." .

:GraphPredicate
    a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Graph Predicate" ;
    rdfs:label "predicado de grafo"@es ;
    skos:definition "Operando hoja de una cláusula de regla que representa una condición booleana evaluada mediante recorrido del grafo o una consulta ASK de SPARQL, en lugar de una comparación escalar o categórica. predicateName identifica el recorrido con nombre que ejecuta el orquestador; la lógica del recorrido vive en el código del agente, no en el grafo."@es ;
    rdfs:comment "A leaf RuleClause operand representing a boolean condition evaluated via graph traversal / a SPARQL ASK query rather than a scalar or categorical comparison — e.g. VETO_RED_01's HasSharedPrimaryVetoExecutive(A) (and, as a second use since DATA_QUALITY and T-187, a condition evaluated upstream: see predicateName) over the sharedExecutiveWith network and T-1 veto state. DISCOVERED DURING IMPLEMENTATION alongside CategoricalComparison, for the same reason: VETO_RED_01 doesn't fit the numeric/categorical leaf shapes either. predicateName identifies which named traversal the Orchestrator agent (08-agent-architecture.md) runs; the traversal logic itself lives in agent code, not in the graph." .

:Portfolio
    a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Portfolio" ;
    rdfs:label "portafolio"@es ;
    skos:definition "El libro de posiciones activas."@es ;
    rdfs:comment "The actively-held book. Closes critique #2 (v1 had exclusion/veto only, no inclusion/holding model)." ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/FND/OwnershipAndControl/Ownership/Portfolio> .

:PortfolioPosition
    a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Portfolio Position" ;
    rdfs:label "posición del portafolio"@es ;
    skos:definition "Relación n-aria: la posición ponderada de un activo dentro de un portafolio durante [validFrom, validTo). Una posición siempre tiene un activo; CASH no es una posición del portafolio: aparece solo como un BookWeightDaily con holdingKey \"CASH\" en el backtest."@es ;
    rdfs:comment "N-ary relation: one Asset's weighted position within one Portfolio over [validFrom, validTo). A position always has an asset; CASH is not a PortfolioPosition: it appears only as a BookWeightDaily with holdingKey \"CASH\" in the backtest." ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/FBC/ProductsAndServices/FinancialProductsAndServices/Position> .

:PriceObservation
    a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Price Observation" ;
    rdfs:label "observación de precio"@es ;
    skos:definition "Resumen diario derivado de un activo (cierre, retorno, volatilidad, ATR, momentum), no un precio negociado. El cierre está ajustado por splits a la fecha de descarga y no por dividendos, por lo que su retorno es solo de precio; los retornos con dividendos se calculan aparte."@es ;
    rdfs:comment "A DERIVED daily summary (close, return, ATR, ...) for one Asset — NOT the raw OHLCV tick panel (see 07-ontology-topology.md)." .

:SectorAggregateSnapshot
    a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Sector Aggregate Snapshot" ;
    rdfs:label "instantánea agregada por sector"@es ;
    skos:definition "Instantánea inmutable y con marca de tiempo que agrega el ScoreTecnico de los activos miembros de un sector en una fecha, escrita por el agente de sector."@es ;
    rdfs:comment "Immutable, timestamped roll-up of member Assets' ScoreTecnico for one Sector on one date, written by the Sector Agent (08-agent-architecture.md). Added 2026-08-13, closes part of critique #3 (sector layer) -- see docs/superpowers/specs/2026-08-13-attractiveness-sector-momentum-design.md." .

:AttractivenessSnapshot
    a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Attractiveness Snapshot" ;
    rdfs:label "instantánea de atractivo"@es ;
    skos:definition "Resultado inmutable del ranking de atractivo de un activo en un ciclo de selección: su puntuación combinada de atractivo. No es lo contrario de un veto: un activo puede tener ambos, y un veto SOFT resta de la puntuación combinada los penaltyPoints de su regla. La marca selected indica pertenencia al conjunto candidato de 60, no a los como máximo 30 nombres mantenidos; targetWeight es el peso del ciclo sobre ese conjunto, nunca el peso de la cartera."@es ;
    rdfs:comment "The Orchestrator's immutable attractiveness ranking result for one Asset in one selection cycle: its combined attractiveness score. It is not the opposite of a Veto: an Asset can have both, and a SOFT veto subtracts its rule's penaltyPoints from the blended score. The class stores the Asset (or, when the universe database does not know the ticker, :rankingTicker), the score, the computation time, the scheme and, for the backtest selection side, the cycle, rank, selection flag, target weight and the upstream veto_rules_json. :selectedForBook is candidate-pool membership (60 names), not the at most 30 held; :targetWeight is the cycle's own pool weight, not a portfolio weight; :rankPosition counts vetoed names too. For a live read the rank remains a query-time ORDER BY over the score. Closes part of critique #2/evolution layer B3's ranking half (not the position-sizing half). Added 2026-08-13; selection-side properties added by Work item 26 (T-322)." .

:AttractivenessWeightScheme
    a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Attractiveness Weight Scheme" ;
    rdfs:label "esquema de ponderación del atractivo"@es ;
    skos:definition "Combinación de pesos que respalda attractivenessScore de una instantánea de atractivo, tal como la registró el ejecutor de ciclos del sistema de origen para un solo cycle_run. Se lee del sistema de origen y nunca se aplica aquí. Un esquema por ejecución es una observación, no un esquema válido en el tiempo; el esquema histórico WeightScheme_v1 sí lo es."@es ;
    rdfs:comment "The blend behind AttractivenessSnapshot.attractivenessScore, as upstream's cycle runner recorded it for ONE cycle_run (read from upstream, never applied here; T-121). Two shapes of individual: an upstream scheme is a per-run observation (schemeId 'cycle_run:<id>', cycleDate = v_weight_scheme.cycle_date, never closed, never updated: a later run is a new scheme; written to urn:graph:ingest:ORCHESTRATOR:{cycleDate} with the snapshots that point at it); the design-history WeightScheme_v1 is a versioned scheme valid over [validFrom, validTo). A per-run scheme is deliberately NOT valid-time, so its absent validTo never reads as 'still active'. Carries upstream's book-weighting rule (:bookWeightingRule) and scalar knobs. Added 2026-08-13; per-run since T-121." .

:WeightComponent
    a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Weight Component" ;
    rdfs:label "componente de ponderación"@es ;
    skos:definition "Par (métrica, peso) dentro de un esquema de ponderación del atractivo, configurado por el sistema de origen para una ejecución: uno por score_type (FUNDAMENTAL, VALORIZATION, TECHNICAL y, en ejecuciones antiguas, SEMANTIC). SectorRelativeMomentum no tiene peso en el sistema de origen. :inverted es historia de diseño opcional."@es ;
    rdfs:comment "One (metric, weight) pair: a configured weight inside an AttractivenessWeightScheme (one per score_type: FUNDAMENTAL, VALORIZATION, TECHNICAL, plus SEMANTIC in older runs; SectorRelativeMomentum has no upstream weight), or a per-asset effective weight reached from an AttractivenessSnapshot by :hasEffectiveWeight, where :componentValue carries the value that run used. :inverted is optional design history (T-121). Added 2026-08-13; effective-weight use added by Work item 26 (T-322)." .

#################################################################
# 1.0 CONTRACT v18 CLASSES (T-206, 2026-11-01) — one class per
# view added between v12 and v18. Backbone placement is in section
# 1.2 below, by property shape. Spanish labels/definitions are the
# approved handoff §6.2 text verbatim (outer « » delimiters dropped).
# No rdfs:seeAlso to FIBO: handoff §6.1 says FIBO has no class for
# backtest runs, strategy arms, GUARD rules, Sharpe, drawdown,
# turnover, costs or paired statistical tests. Every m018 class
# carries :knowledgeDate (section 3) so knowledgeDate <= D queries
# work uniformly; the m015/m016 classes do not (their views have no
# knowledge_date column).
#################################################################

:TickerHistory
    a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Ticker History" ;
    rdfs:label "historial de símbolo bursátil"@es ;
    skos:definition "Registro histórico de cada símbolo bursátil (ticker) utilizado por una línea de emisor (identificada por su CIK en la SEC) durante un intervalo [validFrom, validTo]. Permite resolver el símbolo vigente en cada fecha histórica."@es ;
    rdfs:comment "One row of v_ticker_history (m016): a point-in-time symbol for one CIK line over the INCLUSIVE interval [validFrom, validTo]. validTo absent means the current symbol. The optional :tickerHistoryAsset link is v_ticker_history.asset_id (LEFT JOIN on canonical_symbol); :evidenceUrl/:evidenceDate are optional here because the v18 shape contract keeps them optional even though the m016 DDL marks them NOT NULL." .

:OrchestratorRun
    a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Orchestrator Run" ;
    rdfs:label "ejecución del orquestador"@es ;
    skos:definition "Registro de una corrida del orquestador del sistema (pipeline completo o comando individual), con su identificador de seguimiento (handle), fecha de corte (as_of), estado y configuración."@es ;
    rdfs:comment "One row of v_orchestrator_run (m015): a pipeline or single-command run with its handle, as_of, status, surface and settings. Immutable dated process record (Observation), not a metric snapshot; no knowledgeDate because the view has none. The view has 0 rows in the completed backtest databases, so its shape is exercised by synthetic cases only." .

:OrchestratorStep
    a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Orchestrator Step" ;
    rdfs:label "paso de ejecución del orquestador"@es ;
    skos:definition "Paso individual ejecutado dentro de una corrida del orquestador, con su orden, estado, tiempos de inicio y fin, código de salida y referencia al registro de corrida del subsistema correspondiente."@es ;
    rdfs:comment "One row of v_orchestrator_step (m015): one step of an OrchestratorRun, keyed by (orchestrator_run_id, ordinal). Links to its run by :stepOfOrchestratorRun; :runId (when present) is the step's own run-log id written '<run table>:<id>' from run_kind. The view has 0 rows in the completed backtest databases, so its shape is exercised by synthetic cases only." .

:StrategyBook
    a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Strategy Book"@en ;
    rdfs:label "libro de estrategia de backtest"@es ;
    skos:definition "Brazo experimental de una corrida de backtest en una ventana histórica (P<n> o H<n>, por ejemplo P1, H1, P3, H2, P2 o H3): MARKOWITZ_BASE (optimización de mínima varianza sobre todo el universo elegible sin selección de ciclo), TOPN_MV_NOGUARD (selección del pool Top-N del ciclo + mínima varianza sin GUARD), TOPN_MV_GUARD_NO_NLP (selección del pool Top-N del ciclo + mínima varianza con protección diaria GUARD activa) o MARKOWITZ_BASE_GUARD (la misma optimización de MARKOWITZ_BASE con protección GUARD)."@es  .

:BookRebalance
    a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Book Rebalance" ;
    rdfs:label "rebalanceo programado del libro"@es ;
    skos:definition "Rebalanceo periódico de un libro de estrategia (cada 21 sesiones de NYSE): vincula la fecha de decisión (cierre de t-1) y la fecha de ejecución (cierre de t) con el portafolio de Markowitz, el modelo de riesgo y la corrida de selección del ciclo."@es ;
    rdfs:comment "One row of v_book_rebalance (m018): a scheduled rebalance of one StrategyBook every 21 NYSE sessions. A dated n-ary relation (book, decision/execution dates, upstream quant/cycle/risk-model ids), so a TemporalRelation. :cycleRunId is optional (NULL on MARKOWITZ_BASE); the three upstream ids are literals, not nodes in this graph." .

:GuardAlert
    a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Guard Alert"@en ;
    rdfs:label "alerta diaria de GUARD"@es ;
    skos:definition "Alerta de riesgo generada al cierre de una sesión por las capas de protección diaria GUARD: corte individual por pérdida acumulada o por Basing Points (capa 1, L1_STOP_LOSS / L1_REENTRY / L1_BP_STOP / L1_BP_REENTRY), volatilidad ex-ante del portafolio (capa 3, L3_VOL) o caída acumulada desde el máximo (capa 4, L4_DD)."@es  .

:GuardAction
    a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Guard Action"@en ;
    rdfs:label "acción de GUARD sobre un libro"@es ;
    skos:definition "Evaluación y efecto de una alerta de GUARD sobre un libro de estrategia para la sesión siguiente (effective_date): APPLIED (aplicada), ARM_DISABLED (registrada como contrafactual en el brazo sin GUARD), NOT_HELD (activo no mantenido en cartera) o SUPERSEDED."@es  .

:BookWeightDaily
    a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Book Weight Daily" ;
    rdfs:label "peso de tenencia en el libro"@es ;
    skos:definition "Peso objetivo de un activo o de la posición en efectivo (CASH) dentro de un libro de estrategia en sus fechas de decisión y ejecución (peso objetivo de Markowitz y peso objetivo final tras GUARD)."@es ;
    rdfs:comment "One row of v_book_weight_daily (m018): one holding's weight in one StrategyBook on one date, keyed by (book, date, holding_key). A dated measurement, so an Observation. A holding_key 'CASH' row has no :holdingAsset and must not require an Asset node; :holdingName and both target weights are optional (NULL on ordinary sessions, where the view masks them)." .

:BookDailyPerformance
    a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Book Daily Performance" ;
    rdfs:label "desempeño diario del libro"@es ;
    skos:definition "Serie diaria a nivel de portafolio de un libro de estrategia: retorno bruto, rotación (turnover), costo de transacción (10 bps), retorno neto, valor liquidativo (NAV), caída desde el máximo (drawdown), peso en efectivo, número de acciones y retorno del índice equiponderado interno (SP500_EW_INTERNAL)."@es ;
    rdfs:comment "One row of v_book_daily_performance (m018): one StrategyBook's portfolio-level daily series, keyed by (book, date). A dated measurement, so an Observation. :benchmarkReturn is optional (NULL upstream). No sign or range constraint is placed on :drawdown or :costReturn: the handoff states no sign convention, even though the three completed databases hold non-negative magnitudes." .

:PortfolioPeriodSummary
    a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Portfolio Period Summary" ;
    rdfs:label "resumen de desempeño por período"@es ;
    skos:definition "Estadísticas consolidadas de un libro de estrategia en una ventana o subperíodo de backtest (P1, H1, P3, H2, P2 con P2a y P2b, H3): retorno acumulado y anualizado, volatilidad anualizada, ratio de Sharpe ex-post sobre la tasa libre de riesgo diaria (FF_RF_DAILY), máximo drawdown, rotación total, costo total en puntos básicos, número de rebalanceos y número de acciones de GUARD."@es ;
    rdfs:comment "One row of v_portfolio_period_summary (m018): consolidated statistics of one StrategyBook over one segment (P1, H1, P3, H2, P2 with P2a/P2b, H3), keyed by (book, segment). Order by :dateFrom, never by the segment name (P3 precedes P2). A derived observation. No sign or range constraint is placed on :maxDrawdown (the handoff states no sign convention)." .

:BacktestTest
    a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Backtest Test" ;
    rdfs:label "prueba estadística pareada de backtest"@es ;
    skos:definition "Resultado de una prueba de hipótesis pareada entre dos brazos de estrategia en un segmento (Jobson-Korkie con corrección de Memmel, bootstrap en bloques de Ledoit-Wolf para el ratio de Sharpe, diferencia de medias diarias con errores estándar HAC de Newey-West y bootstrap circular pareado en bloques de la diferencia de máximo drawdown MDD(arm_a) − MDD(arm_b) en el segmento, bloque 5, 4999 réplicas, semilla 20261104; el estadístico es esa diferencia como fracción, positiva cuando arm_a cayó más; el valor p es bilateral; fuente: src/cycle/backtest/stats.py::bootstrap_mdd_diff): estadístico, valor p y número de sesiones."@es ;
    rdfs:comment "One row of v_backtest_test (m018): a paired hypothesis test between two strategy arms in one segment, keyed by (backtest_run_id, segment, arm_a, arm_b, test). A derived observation. :armA/:armB use the same arm vocabulary as :armCode; :testName is memmel_jk | ledoit_wolf | hac_mean_diff | bootstrap_mdd. bootstrap_mdd is upstream's paired circular block bootstrap of the maximum-drawdown difference MDD(arm_a) − MDD(arm_b) in the segment (block 5, 4999 replicates, seed 20261104; the statistic is that difference as a fraction, positive when arm_a fell more; the p-value is two-sided). Source: src/cycle/backtest/stats.py::bootstrap_mdd_diff. :backtestRunId is still the literal link; run metadata is :BacktestRun (Work item 33)." .

:BacktestRun
    a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Backtest Run" ;
    rdfs:label "corrida de backtest"@es ;
    skos:definition "Artefacto de una corrida de backtest identificado por su etiqueta, su ventana y su backtest_run_id: el archivo fuente, su hash SHA-256, la fecha de conocimiento y la configuración con la que se ejecutó."@es ;
    rdfs:comment "Work item 33: one backtest run artefact per label and window. It carries the run label and window, the integer backtest_run_id, the source file name, its lowercase SHA-256 from the distribution's SHA256SUMS, the knowledge date and the :runConfiguration link. The m018 rows keep identifying their run by the literal :backtestRunId; this class is the run metadata the loader writes to urn:graph:derived:backtest:meta:{label} in Work item 35." .

:RunConfiguration
    a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Run Configuration" ;
    rdfs:label "configuración de la corrida"@es ;
    skos:definition "Configuración congelada de una etiqueta de backtest: la etiqueta, el identificador de configuración, el commit de código, la pull request, el documento de resultados y el estado que produjeron la familia de corridas."@es ;
    rdfs:comment """Portfolio system configuration B5, the final configuration (label final, code_commit 5958c6b). Nominally, every 21
trading sessions the book is rebuilt as 50% SPY (core) and 50% satellite; the realized composition differs because of
the trend filter, the optimiser and GUARD. The satellite is chosen from the point-in-time S&P 500 members: technical,
valuation and LLM-scored fundamental scores are blended, hard vetoes exclude a company and soft vetoes lower its score,
and the top 60 names form the candidate pool; the score only delimits the pool and does not drive the weights. A
minimum-variance optimisation (Ledoit-Wolf constant-correlation covariance, 756 sessions) keeps at most 30 names, with a
name cap of 1.5 divided by the number of names held and a 30% sector cap; those names are then weighted by minimum
conditional value-at-risk (confidence 0.95) over the same 756 sessions, under the same caps. A trend filter compares SPY's
total-return index with its own 210-session simple average at each decision date and moves half of the book to cash
when it is below. After every close GUARD sets the next session's weights: layer 1 is a Basing Points stop on satellite
names; layer 3 scales exposure by volatility and never acted in any window; layer 4 scales all the reference weights,
including the SPY core, by the fall of the portfolio's value from its running maximum; layer 2 (news) is off. Costs are
10 basis points of turnover, and cash earns the Kenneth French daily risk-free rate. The four arms compare this system
with and without GUARD against a minimum-variance book over the whole eligible universe, with and without GUARD; that
book's GUARD keeps the original layer-1 stop-loss. All six windows were seen before the final configuration was chosen,
so every result is in-sample.""" .

:AggregatesSet
    a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Aggregates Set" ;
    rdfs:label "conjunto de agregados por segmento"@es ;
    skos:definition "Conjunto de agregados por segmento publicado por el backtest para una etiqueta: el archivo fuente, su hash SHA-256, la configuración y las descripciones de las fuentes. Las filas de estado del filtro de tendencia y de retorno de las referencias lo referencian."@es ;
    rdfs:comment "One aggregates file per backtest label (aggregates_<label>.json): the source file name, its lowercase SHA-256 from the distribution's SHA256SUMS, the configuration id and the three textual source descriptions. It is the per-label root the trend-filter and reference-return rows point at with :aggregatesSet. Work item 37." .

:TrendFilterState
    a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Trend Filter State" ;
    rdfs:label "estado del filtro de tendencia"@es ;
    skos:definition "Estado del filtro de tendencia de la cartera Top-N en una fecha de decisión: si el cierre de SPY estaba por debajo de la media simple de sus últimos 210 cierres, la fracción de la cartera Top-N movida a efectivo y los brazos a los que se aplica. No publica ningún nivel de precio ni la media."@es ;
    rdfs:comment "One row of aggregates_<label>.json trend_filter: the trend state of SPY against the simple mean of its last 210 session closes at one decision date, the cash fraction the filter moved to cash, and the two Top-N arms it applies to. :trendState is below | at_or_above | not_evaluable; no price level or mean is published. Work item 37." .

:ReferenceReturn
    a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Reference Return" ;
    rdfs:label "retorno de una referencia por segmento"@es ;
    skos:definition "Retorno total y caída máxima de una referencia (SPY o SP500_EW_INTERNAL) en un segmento de reporte, calculados por el sistema de origen sobre las sesiones del segmento. Es un agregado por segmento, no una serie diaria."@es ;
    rdfs:comment "One row of aggregates_<label>.json reference_returns: the total return and max drawdown of one reference (SPY or SP500_EW_INTERNAL) over one reporting segment. A per-segment aggregate only; no daily series, price level or 210-session average is stored. Work item 37." .

:SelectionCycle
    a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Selection Cycle" ;
    rdfs:label "ciclo de selección"@es ;
    skos:definition "Registro de una corrida del motor de ciclos del sistema de origen (v_cycle_run): tipo de ciclo, fecha de corte, estado y marcas de tiempo de una corrida de selección, monitoreo o repetición."@es ;
    rdfs:comment "One row of v_cycle_run (m018 selection side): the run log of one cycle-engine run, keyed by its integer id. A process record, so an Observation like OrchestratorRun, not a metric snapshot. :cycleRunId is the id a BookRebalance and an AttractivenessWeightScheme carry; :runId is the D7 form 'cycle_run:<id>'. A backtest database's runs are REPLAY by construction. Added by Work item 26 (T-322)." .

#################################################################
# 1.1 SHARED-PROPERTY SUPERCLASSES — precise ranges for properties
# whose target is "one of several classes" (replaces looser
# rdfs:Resource ranges).
#
# REVISED 2026-08-23: previously declared via owl:unionOf (see git
# history / 06-ontology-definition.md §1.5/§1.8 for the original
# form). owl:unionOf makes a class's membership condition *necessary
# and sufficient* (equivalent to the union) — harmless as long as
# nothing else is ever asserted rdfs:subClassOf it, but that is
# exactly what section 1.2 below now does (AttractivenessSnapshot
# under ObservationSnapshot). Keeping both would make ObservationSnapshot
# unsatisfiable under a DL reasoner: unionOf entails every instance is
# ScoreSnapshot-or-SectorAggregateSnapshot, while AttractivenessSnapshot
# is asserted disjoint from both via AllDisjointClasses below. Plain
# rdfs:subClassOf (ordinary, one-directional subsumption) has no such
# equivalence and creates no such conflict, so that's what these three
# classes use now. RDFS domain entailment for the properties that
# reference them (backedBy's range, operand1/operand2's range,
# normalizedScore/metricType/agentOrigin/timestamp's domain) is
# unaffected either way — those are unchanged below. Individuals can
# now additionally be queried by these types directly (e.g.
# `?x a :ObservationSnapshot`), which owl:unionOf could not support
# without a DL reasoner materializing the union.
#################################################################

:EvidenceSource
    a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Evidence Source" ;
    rdfs:comment "Anything a RiskEvent can be backedBy." .
:NewsArticle rdfs:subClassOf :EvidenceSource .
:SECFilingSection rdfs:subClassOf :EvidenceSource .
:DataQualityIssue rdfs:subClassOf :EvidenceSource .

:RuleOperand
    a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Rule Operand" ;
    rdfs:comment "Anything a RuleClause's operand1/operand2 or a RuleDefinition's hasClause can point to — a nested clause, or one of the three leaf comparison kinds." .
:RuleClause rdfs:subClassOf :RuleOperand .
:ThresholdComparison rdfs:subClassOf :RuleOperand .
:CategoricalComparison rdfs:subClassOf :RuleOperand .
:GraphPredicate rdfs:subClassOf :RuleOperand .

:ObservationSnapshot
    a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Observation Snapshot" ;
    rdfs:comment "Groups the ScoreSnapshot-shaped individuals: metricType/agentOrigin/timestamp/normalizedScore's shared shape. Added 2026-08-13 (ScoreSnapshot, SectorAggregateSnapshot); AttractivenessSnapshot added 2026-08-23 (§1.2) — it shares the same immutable/timestamped shape even though it's also thematically an Orchestrator decision output like Veto." .
:ScoreSnapshot rdfs:subClassOf :ObservationSnapshot .
:SectorAggregateSnapshot rdfs:subClassOf :ObservationSnapshot .
:AttractivenessSnapshot rdfs:subClassOf :ObservationSnapshot .

#################################################################
# 1.2 CLASS TAXONOMY (added 2026-08-23) — an rdfs:subClassOf
# backbone over the 24 disjoint leaf classes below, none of which
# had any subClassOf structure among themselves before this
# revision (only GICS Sector/Industry, via skos:Concept, did).
# Placement is decided by shared property shape, not theme — see
# 06-ontology-definition.md §1.2 for the full rationale and the
# ASCII tree. Six broad categories, four of them with one
# intervening mid-level category.
#################################################################

:DomainEntity a owl:Class ; rdfs:label "Domain Entity"@en .
:TemporalRelation a owl:Class ; rdfs:label "Temporal Relation"@en .
:Observation a owl:Class ; rdfs:label "Observation"@en .
:RiskAndDecision a owl:Class ; rdfs:label "Risk and Decision"@en .
:RuleSystem a owl:Class ; rdfs:label "Rule System"@en .
# NOTE: :Evidence would be the sixth broad category name, but it collides
# with nothing here — EvidenceSource (1.1 above) is its child, declared
# below with an explicit rdfs:subClassOf edge rather than repeating its
# owl:Class declaration.
:Evidence a owl:Class ; rdfs:label "Evidence"@en .

:ClassificationConcept a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf :DomainEntity ;
    rdfs:label "Classification Concept"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "GICS reference concepts. Their internal Sector/Industry hierarchy is a parallel skos:broader tree over skos:Concept individuals in reference.ttl, not further rdfs:subClassOf structure -- SKOS and OWL subsumption answer different questions, deliberately kept separate." .
:Collection a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf :DomainEntity ; rdfs:label "Collection"@en .
:SourceDocument a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf :Evidence ; rdfs:label "Source Document"@en .
:AttractivenessScheme a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf :RuleSystem ; rdfs:label "Attractiveness Scheme"@en .

:EvidenceSource rdfs:subClassOf :Evidence .
:RuleOperand rdfs:subClassOf :RuleSystem .
:ObservationSnapshot rdfs:subClassOf :Observation .

:Asset rdfs:subClassOf :DomainEntity .
:ExchangeTradedFund rdfs:subClassOf :Asset .
:Executive rdfs:subClassOf :DomainEntity .
:Sector rdfs:subClassOf :ClassificationConcept .
:Industry rdfs:subClassOf :ClassificationConcept .
:Universe rdfs:subClassOf :Collection .
:Portfolio rdfs:subClassOf :Collection .

:UniverseMembership rdfs:subClassOf :TemporalRelation .
:PortfolioPosition rdfs:subClassOf :TemporalRelation .

:PriceObservation rdfs:subClassOf :Observation .

:SECFiling rdfs:subClassOf :SourceDocument .

:RiskEvent rdfs:subClassOf :RiskAndDecision .
:Veto rdfs:subClassOf :RiskAndDecision .

:AssetCoOccurrence rdfs:subClassOf :Observation .
:BenchmarkObservation rdfs:subClassOf :Observation .

:RuleDefinition rdfs:subClassOf :RuleSystem .
:RuleClause rdfs:subClassOf :RuleSystem .
:AttractivenessWeightScheme rdfs:subClassOf :AttractivenessScheme .
:WeightComponent rdfs:subClassOf :AttractivenessScheme .
# NOTE: RuleClause is deliberately dual-parented (also :RuleOperand, section 1.1 above) --
# found missing here during the 2026-08-23 review pass even though 06-ontology-definition.md's
# own §1.2.1 spec always included it. It's a genuine, structurally-justified exception to this
# taxonomy's otherwise-single-inheritance design (RuleClause is both a rule-tree-structure node
# in its own right, and a valid nested operand of another RuleClause -- see the RuleClause self-loop
# in the object properties above). Sector/Industry (via skos:Concept) are the other two classes
# with >1 rdfs:subClassOf parent in this file, pre-existing and unrelated to this taxonomy.

# T-206 (Contract v18): the 11 new classes, placed by property shape, not theme.
# - TickerHistory and BookRebalance are dated n-ary relations carrying data (a symbol interval;
#   a book x decision/execution date x upstream ids), so TemporalRelation, like UniverseMembership.
# - StrategyBook is a named pool of holdings, so Collection, like Portfolio.
# - OrchestratorRun/Step, GuardAlert, BookWeightDaily, BookDailyPerformance,
#   PortfolioPeriodSummary and BacktestTest are immutable dated records with scalar fields and no
#   valid-time interval, so Observation, like PriceObservation/BenchmarkObservation. OrchestratorRun
#   and OrchestratorStep are process provenance, not metric snapshots, which is why they are plain
#   Observation and not ObservationSnapshot.
# - GuardAction is the effect/decision taken on a book for the next session, not a measurement,
#   so RiskAndDecision, beside RiskEvent/Veto.
:TickerHistory rdfs:subClassOf :TemporalRelation .
:BookRebalance rdfs:subClassOf :TemporalRelation .
:StrategyBook rdfs:subClassOf :Collection .
:OrchestratorRun rdfs:subClassOf :Observation .
:OrchestratorStep rdfs:subClassOf :Observation .
:GuardAlert rdfs:subClassOf :Observation .
:GuardAction rdfs:subClassOf :RiskAndDecision .
:BookWeightDaily rdfs:subClassOf :Observation .
:BookDailyPerformance rdfs:subClassOf :Observation .
:PortfolioPeriodSummary rdfs:subClassOf :Observation .
:BacktestTest rdfs:subClassOf :Observation .
:SelectionCycle rdfs:subClassOf :Observation .
# Work item 33: a run artefact is an immutable dated record (Observation); a frozen configuration
# belongs with the rule systems, like AttractivenessWeightScheme.
:BacktestRun rdfs:subClassOf :Observation .
:RunConfiguration rdfs:subClassOf :RuleSystem .
# Work item 37: the aggregates file is a per-label artefact and its two row types are immutable
# dated observations, like the run metadata.
:AggregatesSet rdfs:subClassOf :Observation .
:TrendFilterState rdfs:subClassOf :Observation .
:ReferenceReturn rdfs:subClassOf :Observation .

#################################################################
# 1.3 DISJOINTNESS — every individual belongs to exactly one of
# these 44 classes. ExchangeTradedFund is deliberately absent: it is
# a subclass of Asset, not a sibling. EvidenceSource/RuleOperand/ObservationSnapshot
# (§1.1) and every §1.2 taxonomy class are deliberately excluded --
# they're superclasses of members of this list, and a superclass is
# never disjoint from its own subclasses.
#################################################################

[] a owl:AllDisjointClasses ;
   owl:members ( :Asset :Sector :Industry :Universe :UniverseMembership :ScoreSnapshot
                 :RiskEvent :NewsArticle :SECFiling :SECFilingSection :DataQualityIssue :Executive :Veto :AssetCoOccurrence :BenchmarkObservation
                 :RuleDefinition :RuleClause :ThresholdComparison :CategoricalComparison
                 :GraphPredicate :Portfolio :PortfolioPosition :PriceObservation
                 :SectorAggregateSnapshot :AttractivenessSnapshot :AttractivenessWeightScheme
                 :WeightComponent
                 :TickerHistory :OrchestratorRun :OrchestratorStep :StrategyBook :BookRebalance
                 :GuardAlert :GuardAction :BookWeightDaily :BookDailyPerformance
                 :PortfolioPeriodSummary :BacktestTest :SelectionCycle
                 :BacktestRun :RunConfiguration
                 :AggregatesSet :TrendFilterState :ReferenceReturn
                 :FundamentalMetricSet :FundamentalAssessment ) .

#################################################################
# 2. OBJECT PROPERTIES
#################################################################

:hasScoreObservation a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:domain :Asset ; rdfs:range :ScoreSnapshot ;
    owl:inverseOf :scoreSnapshotOfAsset ;
    rdfs:comment "v1 §3A: (Asset)-[:HAS_SCORE_OBSERVATION]->(ScoreSnapshot)." .
:scoreSnapshotOfAsset a owl:ObjectProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :ScoreSnapshot ; rdfs:range :Asset .

:hasUniverseMembership a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:domain :Asset ; rdfs:range :UniverseMembership ;
    owl:inverseOf :membershipAsset .
:membershipAsset a owl:ObjectProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :UniverseMembership ; rdfs:range :Asset .
:membershipUniverse a owl:ObjectProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :UniverseMembership ; rdfs:range :Universe .

:classifiedAs a owl:ObjectProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :Asset ; rdfs:range :Industry ;
    owl:inverseOf :industryOfAsset ;
    rdfs:comment "An Asset's GICS industry group. Functional: one primary industry per Asset at a time." .
:industryOfAsset a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:domain :Industry ; rdfs:range :Asset .

:memberOfSector a owl:ObjectProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :Industry ; rdfs:range :Sector ;
    owl:inverseOf :sectorIndustries ;
    rdfs:comment "GICS industry -> sector roll-up (07-ontology-topology.md reasoning profile)." .
:sectorIndustries a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:domain :Sector ; rdfs:range :Industry .

:triggeredVeto a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:domain :Asset ; rdfs:range :Veto ;
    owl:inverseOf :vetoOfAsset .
:vetoOfAsset a owl:ObjectProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :Veto ; rdfs:range :Asset .

:triggeredBy a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:domain :Veto ; rdfs:range :RiskEvent ;
    rdfs:comment "v1 §3B: (Veto)-[:DISPARADO_POR]->(RiskEvent)." .

:backedBy a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:domain :RiskEvent ; rdfs:range :EvidenceSource ;
    owl:inverseOf :evidenceForRiskEvent ;
    rdfs:comment "SHACL requires sh:minCount 1: no RiskEvent may exist without >=1 evidence link (closes critique #5)." .
:evidenceForRiskEvent a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:domain :EvidenceSource ; rdfs:range :RiskEvent ;
    rdfs:comment "Inverse of backedBy — supports 'which risk events cite this article/section' audit queries (evolution layer B9)." .

:appliesRule a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:domain :Veto ; rdfs:range :RuleDefinition ;
    rdfs:comment "All rules that fired for this Veto (v1 'Mapeo de Activaciones Multiples')." .

:primaryRule a owl:ObjectProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :Veto ; rdfs:range :RuleDefinition ;
    rdfs:comment "The single lowest-priorityRank rule among appliesRule (v1 §4)." .

:hasClause a owl:ObjectProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :RuleDefinition ; rdfs:range :RuleOperand ;
    rdfs:comment "Root of the rule's expression tree. May point directly to a leaf comparison for single-signal rules (e.g. VETO_FIN_01) — the tree degenerates gracefully to one node." .

:operand1 a owl:ObjectProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :RuleClause ; rdfs:range :RuleOperand .
:operand2 a owl:ObjectProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :RuleClause ; rdfs:range :RuleOperand .

:hasExecutive a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:domain :Asset ; rdfs:range :Executive ;
    rdfs:comment "Extracted from DEF 14A (v1 §2B)." .

:sharedExecutiveWith a owl:ObjectProperty, owl:SymmetricProperty ; rdfs:domain :Asset ; rdfs:range :Asset ;
    rdfs:comment "Derived/asserted by the entity-resolution service (roadmap step 7), never hand-authored. Backs VETO_RED_01's HasSharedPrimaryVetoExecutive(A) check (v1 §4). T-107 (D10): reserved for VERIFIED shared directorships (e.g. from DEF 14A). Upstream's news co-occurrence candidates are projected as :AssetCoOccurrence individuals instead and must never be written as this property." .

:partOfFiling a owl:ObjectProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :SECFilingSection ; rdfs:range :SECFiling .
:filingOfAsset a owl:ObjectProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :SECFiling ; rdfs:range :Asset .

:supersededBy a owl:ObjectProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :SECFilingSection ; rdfs:range :SECFilingSection ;
    rdfs:comment "Points from an original section to its corrected/restated replacement. The named-graph the replacement lands in carries the new transaction-time; both stay queryable (closes critique #8, worked example in instances.trig). A section is superseded once, by a new section of the same itemLabel declared in the same batch (T-032; the ingest gate's check 8); the sections not superseded are the current ones. See 07-ontology-topology.md, Restatements and re-runs." .

:holdsPosition a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:domain :Portfolio ; rdfs:range :PortfolioPosition .
:positionAsset a owl:ObjectProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :PortfolioPosition ; rdfs:range :Asset .

:priceObservationOf a owl:ObjectProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :PriceObservation ; rdfs:range :Asset .

:sectorSnapshotOfSector a owl:ObjectProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :SectorAggregateSnapshot ; rdfs:range :Sector ;
    owl:inverseOf :hasSectorSnapshot .
:hasSectorSnapshot a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:domain :Sector ; rdfs:range :SectorAggregateSnapshot .

:attractivenessOfAsset a owl:ObjectProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :AttractivenessSnapshot ; rdfs:range :Asset ;
    owl:inverseOf :hasAttractivenessSnapshot .
:hasAttractivenessSnapshot a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:domain :Asset ; rdfs:range :AttractivenessSnapshot .

:computedWithScheme a owl:ObjectProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :AttractivenessSnapshot ; rdfs:range :AttractivenessWeightScheme ;
    rdfs:comment "Audit trail -- same role appliesRule/primaryRule play for Veto." .

:rankingOfCycle a owl:ObjectProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :AttractivenessSnapshot ; rdfs:range :SelectionCycle ;
    rdfs:comment "The cycle run a backtest ranking row belongs to (v_cycle_ranking.cycle_run_id, resolved to its SelectionCycle). Written by the selection-side projector; absent on the pre-existing live examples." .

:hasWeightComponent a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:domain :AttractivenessWeightScheme ; rdfs:range :WeightComponent .

:hasEffectiveWeight a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:domain :AttractivenessSnapshot ; rdfs:range :WeightComponent ;
    rdfs:comment "The weight each component actually had for THIS asset (upstream's per-asset renormalization), read from v_cycle_ranking_component.effective_weight. A component absent for the asset has no entry; the entries of one snapshot sum to 1. A snapshot with no such entry is an upstream no-component placeholder (UNSCORED/UNPRICED), kept so the backtest can explain the exclusion." .

#################################################################
# 2.1 CONTRACT v18 OBJECT PROPERTIES (T-206, 2026-11-01)
#
# The m018 links between new classes. Functional only where the data
# guarantees one value: a step has one run, a rebalance one book, an
# action one book and one alert, a weight/performance/summary row one
# book, a ticker-history row at most one asset. The inverse is
# declared only where a reader would traverse the other way.
#
# The m018 views expose no run row, so a book or a test links to its
# run by the literal :backtestRunId; Work item 33 adds :BacktestRun for
# the labelled run metadata the loader writes, never a node per m018 row.
# v_guard_alert has no book_id, so an alert reaches a book through
# its :alertHasGuardAction actions; there is deliberately no direct
# alert-to-book property.
#################################################################

:stepOfOrchestratorRun a owl:ObjectProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :OrchestratorStep ; rdfs:range :OrchestratorRun ;
    owl:inverseOf :orchestratorRunHasStep ;
    rdfs:comment "v_orchestrator_step.orchestrator_run_id, resolved to the OrchestratorRun individual. A step belongs to exactly one run." .
:orchestratorRunHasStep a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:domain :OrchestratorRun ; rdfs:range :OrchestratorStep .

:tickerHistoryAsset a owl:ObjectProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :TickerHistory ; rdfs:range :Asset ;
    owl:inverseOf :assetTickerHistory ;
    rdfs:comment "Optional: v_ticker_history.asset_id (LEFT JOIN on canonical_symbol). A history row is for one CIK line, so at most one asset; a row with no matching asset simply has no link." .
:assetTickerHistory a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:domain :Asset ; rdfs:range :TickerHistory .

:rebalanceOfBook a owl:ObjectProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :BookRebalance ; rdfs:range :StrategyBook ;
    owl:inverseOf :bookHasRebalance .
:bookHasRebalance a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:domain :StrategyBook ; rdfs:range :BookRebalance .

:actionOfBook a owl:ObjectProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :GuardAction ; rdfs:range :StrategyBook ;
    owl:inverseOf :bookHasGuardAction .
:bookHasGuardAction a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:domain :StrategyBook ; rdfs:range :GuardAction .

:actionAlert a owl:ObjectProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :GuardAction ; rdfs:range :GuardAlert ;
    owl:inverseOf :alertHasGuardAction ;
    rdfs:comment "v_guard_action.alert_id: the alert this action evaluates. An alert can have several actions (one per book), so the inverse is not functional." .
:alertHasGuardAction a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:domain :GuardAlert ; rdfs:range :GuardAction .

:alertRule a owl:ObjectProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :GuardAlert ; rdfs:range :RuleDefinition ;
    rdfs:comment "v_guard_alert.rule_id, resolved to the GUARD RuleDefinition (L1_STOP_LOSS, L1_REENTRY, L1_BP_STOP, L1_BP_REENTRY, L2_NEWS, L3_VOL or L4_DD). This is the only way a GUARD rule is reached from an alert; it is not a Veto :appliesRule/:primaryRule target (VetoShape refuses category GUARD)." .

:guardAsset a owl:ObjectProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:range :Asset ;
    rdfs:comment "Optional on GuardAlert and GuardAction. No rdfs:domain so the two classes can share it without entailing each other (the :runId pattern). NULL on layer 3/4 portfolio-level alerts/actions; a CASH weight row uses no asset link at all." .

:weightOfBook a owl:ObjectProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :BookWeightDaily ; rdfs:range :StrategyBook ;
    owl:inverseOf :bookHasWeight ;
    rdfs:comment "v_book_weight_daily.book_id, resolved to the StrategyBook individual." .
:bookHasWeight a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:domain :StrategyBook ; rdfs:range :BookWeightDaily .
:holdingAsset a owl:ObjectProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :BookWeightDaily ; rdfs:range :Asset ;
    rdfs:comment "Optional: v_book_weight_daily.asset_id. A holding_key 'CASH' row has no asset link and must not require an Asset node." .

:performanceOfBook a owl:ObjectProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :BookDailyPerformance ; rdfs:range :StrategyBook ;
    owl:inverseOf :bookHasPerformance .
:bookHasPerformance a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:domain :StrategyBook ; rdfs:range :BookDailyPerformance .

:summaryOfBook a owl:ObjectProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :PortfolioPeriodSummary ; rdfs:range :StrategyBook ;
    owl:inverseOf :bookHasSummary .
:bookHasSummary a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:domain :StrategyBook ; rdfs:range :PortfolioPeriodSummary .

# --- Work item 33: backtest run metadata ---
:runConfiguration a owl:ObjectProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :BacktestRun ; rdfs:range :RunConfiguration ;
    rdfs:comment "The frozen configuration a BacktestRun ran under, one per label (Work item 33). The run's source file and hash stay on the BacktestRun; this link reaches the code commit, pull request and results document." .

#################################################################
# 3. DATATYPE PROPERTIES
#################################################################

:tickerSymbol a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :Asset ; rdfs:range xsd:string ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/SEC/Securities/SecuritiesIdentification/TickerSymbol> .
:companyName  a owl:DatatypeProperty ; rdfs:domain :Asset ; rdfs:range xsd:string .
:cikNumber    a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :Asset ; rdfs:range xsd:string ;
    rdfs:comment "SEC Central Index Key — stable join key to edgar_tool.py output." .

# --- temporal (n-ary relation) properties, shared across UniverseMembership / PortfolioPosition / RuleDefinition ---
:validFrom a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:range xsd:date ;
    rdfs:comment "Valid-time start (06-ontology-definition.md §1.4)." .
:validTo   a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:range xsd:date ;
    rdfs:comment "Valid-time end. Absent/unbound == currently active. On a RuleDefinition (T-187) it is exclusive: the rule is valid on d when validFrom <= d < validTo, and a successor with the same :ruleId starts on that day (the superseded LIQUIDITY_DISTRESS ends 2026-10-10, its redefinition starts then). On a TickerHistory (T-206) and a UniverseMembership (T-260) it is INCLUSIVE: the symbol or membership is valid on d when validFrom <= d <= validTo, because v_ticker_history.valid_to and universe_membership.valid_to are the last valid date (handoff §3.1; T-260), and both shapes use sh:lessThanOrEquals. PortfolioPosition and AttractivenessWeightScheme keep the exclusive reading." .

# --- ScoreSnapshot / SectorAggregateSnapshot (via ObservationSnapshot union) ---
:normalizedScore a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :ObservationSnapshot ; rdfs:range xsd:decimal ;
    rdfs:comment "[0.0, 1.0], 0=no risk, 1=critical risk on ScoreSnapshot; sector-aggregate reading on SectorAggregateSnapshot. Range enforced by SHACL. Projected as 1 - x/100 from upstream's normalized_score (50 + 10*z, clamped to [0, 100]), so it is relative to the cohort, not an absolute risk level. Optional (not required, not forbidden) on a FUNDAMENTAL ScoreSnapshot (ScoreFinanciero) since T-171/D17: upstream rewrites this value in place on every cycle that re-normalizes the filing, which would make an individual carrying it a mutable observation. The per-cycle value is read instead as :componentValue on the matching AttractivenessSnapshot's WeightComponent, scoped to its cycle_run." .
:rawValue    a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :ScoreSnapshot ; rdfs:range xsd:decimal ;
    rdfs:comment "Stable at the source, unlike normalizedScore for some metrics (D17). Carried for SectorRelativeMomentum, Sentiment, and FUNDAMENTAL (ScoreFinanciero, T-171); FUNDAMENTAL's rawValue is bounded to [0, 100] in shapes.ttl (T-177, upstream's answer to Q6)." .
:metricType  a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :ObservationSnapshot ; rdfs:range xsd:string .
:agentOrigin a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :ObservationSnapshot ; rdfs:range xsd:string ;
    rdfs:comment "One of FUNDAMENTAL | SEMANTIC | VALORIZATION | TECHNICAL | SECTOR. SHACL sh:in enforced." .
:timestamp   a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :ObservationSnapshot ; rdfs:range xsd:dateTime .
:scoreMethod a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :ScoreSnapshot ; rdfs:range xsd:string ;
    rdfs:comment "T-111 (D14): optional method discriminator, so two ways of producing the same agentOrigin/metricType can coexist without a reader double-counting or picking the wrong one (upstream semantic-score-boundary.md W11, for the cut-over window). Open vocabulary: upstream has not fixed the value for its per-(asset, day) SEMANTIC aggregate yet, so SHACL does not enumerate it. Every SEMANTIC snapshot carries one: this repo's per-article FinBERT sentiment from src/etl/ is ARTICLE_SENTIMENT, and the worked per-(asset, day) snapshots in instances.trig use the illustrative placeholder ASSET_DAY_AGGREGATE until upstream names its value. A snapshot without scoreMethod is the single method of its agentOrigin (every non-SEMANTIC snapshot today); a new SEMANTIC producer must set it. Not the same as upstream's score_snapshot.model, a label that defaults to 'deterministic'." .
:eventTime   a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :Observation ; rdfs:range xsd:date ;
    rdfs:comment "T-101 (D2): what the observation is ABOUT -- filing period-end (FUNDAMENTAL), cycle date (TECHNICAL, VALORIZATION -- formerly QUANTITATIVE, SECTOR), article day (SEMANTIC). On a FundamentalAssessment it is the filing period-end. Never used to filter as-of reads; see availableAt." .
:availableAt a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:range xsd:date ;
    rdfs:comment "T-101 (D2): first date the observation may be used by a reader (look-ahead guard; for FUNDAMENTAL, the first NYSE trading day after the filing date; for TECHNICAL, VALORIZATION and SECTOR, the cycle date, as upstream's v_score_snapshot defines it; for a fundamentals SECFiling, FundamentalMetricSet or FundamentalAssessment, the delivery's available_at). Read from upstream, never filled in here: a row without it is not projected. Every as-of-D query MUST filter availableAt <= D, never eventTime or timestamp. Distinct from timestamp, which is when the row was computed/ingested. No rdfs:domain: it is shared by ScoreSnapshot and the fundamentals classes, and every carrier is explicitly typed." .

# T-106 (D7): upstream run provenance. No rdfs:domain on purpose (like :provenanceId): D7 says every upstream row carries run_id, and a domain would
# entail :ScoreSnapshot on a :Veto/:PortfolioPosition, contradicting AllDisjointClasses. Per-class use is constrained by SHACL (ScoreSnapshot,
# SectorAggregateSnapshot, Veto, PortfolioPosition, DataQualityIssue, AssetCoOccurrence, BenchmarkObservation); all optional -- ETL-built SEMANTIC snapshots have no upstream run.
# On stint / valid-time individuals (Veto, PortfolioPosition) later cycles append to the SAME individual, so these four record only the run that OPENED
# the record (raised it / validFrom); later cycles must not re-emit them (maxCount 1 / FunctionalProperty would break) and the closing run is not recorded.
:runId a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:range xsd:string ;
    rdfs:comment "T-106 (D7): upstream run_id of the analysis/pricing/quant/cycle run that wrote the row. Upstream's run_id is an INTEGER numbered separately in each run table (analysis_run, pricing_run, quant_run, cycle_run), so a bare number is ambiguous: write it as '<run table>:<id>' (e.g. cycle_run:42; T-109). Joins to the v_analysis_run / v_pricing_run / v_quant_run / v_cycle_run log (params, dirty-tree reason) which stays upstream; no Run class is modelled. T-151: upstream ids can be reused until upstream's T-145 (non-reusable ids) and T-100 (fresh database) have both landed; until then it is emitted only when read checks pass (run row exists, cycle_type matches for cycle_run, row time inside the run), which lowers the risk but does not prove uniqueness." .
:runAsOf a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:range xsd:date ;
    rdfs:comment "T-106 (D7): the run log's as_of (the date the run was evaluated for). NOT a read filter -- as-of reads use availableAt (T-101). Emit it only where it can differ from eventTime (FUNDAMENTAL, backfill replays); for cycle types it equals eventTime." .
:codeVersion a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:range xsd:string ;
    rdfs:comment "T-106 (D7): upstream git SHA of the code that produced the row ('-dirty' suffix only when upstream ran with --allow-dirty). On the external MARKOWITZ_MV book (Work item 44) it is the SHA-256 of sim_v3.py as written in config_mv_base.md, because that book is produced by an independent simulator outside the engine." .
:engineVersion a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:range xsd:string ;
    rdfs:comment "T-106 (D7): upstream engine_version. Upstream writes parallel rows per engine_version and its v_* views pick the newest per key; this records which one was projected. It is a free string with no defined order: readers must NOT rank by it (docs/07 'Run provenance' gives the read rule)." .

# --- RiskEvent / Veto ---
:category a owl:DatatypeProperty ; rdfs:range xsd:string ;
    rdfs:comment "On RiskEvent: LEGAL | FINANCIAL | MARKET | NETWORK. On RuleDefinition: free-text category label (v1's catalog table for the superseded rules; upstream's FINANCIAL | MARKET | DATA_QUALITY for the ten active selection rules; GUARD for the seven GUARD protection rules, T-206 and Work item 33). A GUARD rule is not a veto rule: RuleDefinitionShape accepts it without :ruleSeverity, :penaltyPoints or :priorityRank, and VetoShape refuses it as an :appliesRule/:primaryRule target." .
# --- AssetCoOccurrence (T-107, D10) ---
:coOccurrenceAsset a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:domain :AssetCoOccurrence ; rdfs:range :Asset ;
    rdfs:comment "The two assets linked (SHACL: exactly 2). Unordered, so no direction is implied." .
:coOccurrenceKind a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :AssetCoOccurrence ; rdfs:range xsd:string ;
    rdfs:comment "SHARED_EXECUTIVE_CANDIDATE (upstream shared_executive_edge). The MEDIA kind for media_cooccurrence (non-executive; table unpopulated until upstream's T-082, endpoints unknown) is deliberately NOT enumerated yet: add it, and its own shape rules, once the columns are known; as of T-109 there is no v_* view for media_cooccurrence at all." .
:coOccurrenceMethod a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :AssetCoOccurrence ; rdfs:range xsd:string ;
    rdfs:comment "Upstream method id, e.g. news-per-cooccurrence-v1. Upstream recomputes per method, so different methods are different individuals; readers must filter on it." .
:coOccurrenceWeight a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :AssetCoOccurrence ; rdfs:range xsd:decimal ;
    rdfs:comment "Upstream's edge weight, in the method's own unit (not normalized, not comparable across methods). Upstream emits no separate confidence; none is invented here." .
:coOccurrenceComputedOn a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :AssetCoOccurrence ; rdfs:range xsd:date ;
    rdfs:comment "Optional date the edge set was computed (upstream's v_shared_executive_edge has no computed-at column, only first_seen/last_seen, T-109; runAsOf/runId can carry it). The individual is immutable and a recompute is a new individual in a new dated graph." .

# --- DataQualityIssue (T-104) ---
:dqIssueOfAsset a owl:ObjectProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :DataQualityIssue ; rdfs:range :Asset .
:dqGateCode a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :DataQualityIssue ; rdfs:range xsd:string ;
    rdfs:comment "The Ring-1 gate that fired, e.g. DQ_* code from upstream's data_quality_issue." .
:dqRaisedOn a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :DataQualityIssue ; rdfs:range xsd:date ;
    rdfs:comment "Cycle date the gate fired (as-of key for the issue, like :raisedOn on a Veto)." .
:dqIssueOfFiling a owl:ObjectProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :DataQualityIssue ; rdfs:range :SECFiling ;
    rdfs:comment "Optional: the filing whose data the gate fired on (what DATA_QUALITY's 'latest filing' refers to)." .
:dqMetricName a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :DataQualityIssue ; rdfs:range xsd:string ;
    rdfs:comment "Optional: the gated metric (a ThresholdComparison metricName-style id). Provenance back to upstream's row uses :provenanceId." .
:dqSeverity a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :DataQualityIssue ; rdfs:range xsd:string ;
    rdfs:comment "Upstream's issue severity; HARD escalates to the DATA_QUALITY veto. Other values pass through unconstrained." .
:quarantined a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :DataQualityIssue ; rdfs:range xsd:boolean ;
    rdfs:comment "True when the gated metric was quarantined (reads as NULL upstream)." .
:gatedValue a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :DataQualityIssue ; rdfs:range xsd:decimal ;
    rdfs:comment "The value the gate rejected, when numeric (upstream's type is unconfirmed, T-030); a non-numeric value is carried as :dqMetricName context only, not here." .

:severity a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :RiskEvent ; rdfs:range xsd:string ;
    rdfs:comment "CRITICAL | HIGH | MODERATE | LOW." .
:detectedAt a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :RiskEvent ; rdfs:range xsd:dateTime .
:decidedAt  a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :Veto ; rdfs:range xsd:dateTime .
# T-102: a :Veto is a STINT (upstream's `veto` rows), not a one-cycle event. Dates are cycle dates (xsd:date);
# decidedAt stays the wall-clock detection time (upstream `detected_at`); upstream `cleared_at` (wall-clock close time) is deliberately dropped -- clearedOn is the only close marker.
:raisedOn   a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :Veto ; rdfs:range xsd:date ;
    rdfs:comment "Cycle date on which the stint began (upstream raised_on). Required. Active at cutoff C iff raisedOn <= C AND (no clearedOn OR clearedOn > C); the T-1 lag is this predicate applied at read time (schema/README.md has the SPARQL), not an orchestrator feature. Added 2026-10-03 (T-102)." .
:clearedOn  a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :Veto ; rdfs:range xsd:date ;
    rdfs:comment "Cycle date on which the stint closed (upstream cleared_on): a HARD veto clears when its rule re-evaluates clean. Absent = still active. Closed by writing this triple (in the clearing cycle's ORCHESTRATOR graph), never by deleting the Veto. Added 2026-10-03 (T-102)." .
:expiresOn a owl:DatatypeProperty ; rdfs:domain :Veto ; rdfs:range xsd:date ;
    rdfs:comment "T-188: upstream's expires_on, the date a temporary HARD stint (VOLATILITY_SHOCK, CRASH_Z_SCORE) is next re-checked; never set on a SOFT stint. Optional and deliberately NOT functional, like :lastSeenOn: upstream moves expires_on 10 NYSE sessions on while the condition holds, ORCHESTRATOR graphs are append-only, so each move adds a value in its own graph and the current one is MAX(?expiresOn). Each value is not before :raisedOn (VetoShape). It does NOT close the stint: at the first cycle on or after the current value upstream re-evaluates the rule and writes clearedOn if the condition is gone. Not enforced as HARD-only: the date is harmless on a SOFT stint and the shape cannot see the rule's severity. So a reader tests clearedOn only, and the active-at-cutoff predicate has no expiresOn term. Absent (NULL upstream) = no triple = never reviewed by date. Added 2026-10-13 (T-188)." .
:lastSeenOn a owl:DatatypeProperty ; rdfs:domain :Veto ; rdfs:range xsd:date ;
    rdfs:comment "Most recent cycle date on which the rule still fired for this stint (upstream last_seen_on). Optional and deliberately NOT functional: ORCHESTRATOR graphs are append-only, so each cycle adds a new value in its own graph and the current one is MAX(?lastSeenOn). Added 2026-10-03 (T-102)." .
:vetoSeverity a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :Veto ; rdfs:range xsd:string ;
    rdfs:comment "HARD | SOFT -- this veto row's severity, read per row and authoritative; never the rule catalog's :ruleSeverity. The two can differ: LEVERAGE_EXTREME is HARD in the catalog but emits SOFT for an asset with negative book equity and no usable credit metric. A SOFT stint charges its rule's :penaltyPoints once, or the run's soft_veto_penalty if the rule declares none, a HARD rule's SOFT stint included (assumed, not confirmed by upstream: T-189, T-191 ask 8). Optional: absent means the severity of the stint's :primaryRule (:ruleSeverity; the superseded design-history rules carry none). Added 2026-10-03 (T-102)." .

# --- RuleDefinition / RuleClause / leaf comparisons ---
:ruleId       a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :RuleDefinition ; rdfs:range xsd:string ;
    rdfs:comment "Upstream's rule_id. Two definitions may share it over time (T-187: LIQUIDITY_DISTRESS), but at most one with no :validTo; that is checked by a test (tests/test_schema_gate.py), not by a shape." .
:ruleSeverity a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :RuleDefinition ; rdfs:range xsd:string ;
    rdfs:comment "HARD | SOFT — the severity upstream's rule_catalog assigns the rule (T-103). An individual veto stint's severity can differ (LEVERAGE_EXTREME emits SOFT for a negative-equity firm with no corroborating metric); :Veto carries the per-stint value as :vetoSeverity (T-102). Distinct from :severity, which is a RiskEvent field." .
:priorityRank a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :RuleDefinition ; rdfs:range xsd:integer ;
    rdfs:comment "1 (highest) .. 10 (lowest), used to pick primaryRule (v1 §4); the active selection catalog uses 1 to 10 since T-206 (T-187 widened the shape's range from 7 to 9; T-206 to 10 for UTILITY_CASH_COVERAGE). Ranks are unique among the ACTIVE SELECTION definitions only: a closed rule may repeat one (VETO_MKT_02 and VOLATILITY_SHOCK are both 7; the old and new LIQUIDITY_DISTRESS are both 3). GUARD rules carry no :priorityRank (T-206): they are not veto rules and RuleDefinitionShape makes the rank mandatory only for non-GUARD definitions." .
:penaltyPoints a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :RuleDefinition ; rdfs:range xsd:decimal ;
    rdfs:comment "T-187: upstream's penalty_points, in points of its 0-100 blend (not a fraction), charged once per active SOFT stint of the rule. Set on SOFT rules only (a HARD rule excludes the asset, so upstream's is null and there is no triple). Optional: a SOFT stint whose rule has none costs the run's :softVetoPenalty (15), as upstream does, never 0 (T-189); that includes a SOFT stint of a HARD rule, which has none (assumed, T-191 ask 8). At least 0; BREAK_TREND_200 is the one rule that declares its own (0). The graph only records it; the blend is computed upstream." .
:clauseType   a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :RuleClause ; rdfs:range xsd:string ;
    rdfs:comment "'AND' | 'OR'. SHACL sh:in enforced." .
:metricName   a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :ThresholdComparison ; rdfs:range xsd:string .
:operator     a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :ThresholdComparison ; rdfs:range xsd:string ;
    rdfs:comment "'>' | '<' | '>=' | '<='." .
:thresholdValue a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :ThresholdComparison ; rdfs:range xsd:decimal .
:attributeName a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :CategoricalComparison ; rdfs:range xsd:string ;
    rdfs:comment "e.g. 'category', 'severity' — a RiskEvent field name." .
:expectedValue a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :CategoricalComparison ; rdfs:range xsd:string .
:predicateName a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :GraphPredicate ; rdfs:range xsd:string ;
    rdfs:comment "e.g. 'HasSharedPrimaryVetoExecutive' — identifies which named traversal the Orchestrator runs. For the rules evaluated upstream (DATA_QUALITY, and since T-187 VOLATILITY_SHOCK, CRASH_Z_SCORE and BREAK_TREND_200: a comparison between two quantities or against a sector median, which no scalar leaf states) it is a LABEL chosen here, not an upstream identifier, and nothing in this repo runs it." .

# --- provenance ---
:provenanceId a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:range xsd:string ;
    rdfs:comment "On NewsArticle: 'articles:<id>' / 'discovered_urls:<id>' from the existing SQLite pipeline. On SECFilingSection: an accession-number-based id from the EDGAR batch pipeline." .
:sourceURL    a owl:DatatypeProperty ; rdfs:domain :NewsArticle ; rdfs:range xsd:anyURI .
:publishedDate a owl:DatatypeProperty ; rdfs:domain :NewsArticle ; rdfs:range xsd:date .

# --- SECFiling / SECFilingSection ---
:formType    a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :SECFiling ; rdfs:range xsd:string ;
    rdfs:comment "'10-K' | '10-Q' | '8-K' | 'DEF 14A'." .
:filingDate  a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :SECFiling ; rdfs:range xsd:date .
:accessionNumber a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :SECFiling ; rdfs:range xsd:string .
:itemLabel   a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :SECFilingSection ; rdfs:range xsd:string ;
    rdfs:comment "'ITEM_1A_RISK_FACTORS' | 'ITEM_3_LEGAL_PROCEEDINGS' | 'DEF14A_DIRECTORS'." .

# --- Executive ---
:executiveName a owl:DatatypeProperty ; rdfs:domain :Executive ; rdfs:range xsd:string .
:canonicalId   a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :Executive ; rdfs:range xsd:string .

# --- Portfolio / PortfolioPosition ---
:portfolioName a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :Portfolio ; rdfs:range xsd:string .
# T-108 (D11): benchmark books are Portfolios too; their weights are ordinary PortfolioPositions. A book has ONE stable IRI keyed on upstream's portfolio id
# (like the live book); a later quant run closes superseded weights by validTo on the old PortfolioPosition and opens new ones, it does not mint a new Portfolio.
:portfolioKind a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :Portfolio ; rdfs:range xsd:string ;
    rdfs:comment "LIVE | BENCHMARK, required. Set by which upstream view the book was read from, a fixed mapping and not a judgement: LIVE for the book built from v_portfolio_position (the cycle's selected book), BENCHMARK for optimizer books from v_quant_portfolio. v_quant_portfolio also holds kind='live_book' rows (upstream's snapshot of the live book, taken to measure its return): those are NOT projected as a Portfolio (that would duplicate the live holdings under a BENCHMARK label); their performance numbers attach to the LIVE Portfolio through quantPortfolio (T-109 review). The projection writes the label explicitly; nothing relies on absence." .
:benchmarkObjective a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :Portfolio ; rdfs:range xsd:string ;
    rdfs:comment "Upstream's objective label for a BENCHMARK book, carried verbatim and not interpreted: v_quant_portfolio.objective, the solver result's label. Not a closed list (upstream's configurable defaults are min_var, tangency, target_vol, risk_parity; T-109)." .
:benchmarkKind a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :Portfolio ; rdfs:range xsd:string ;
    rdfs:comment "Optional. Upstream's v_quant_portfolio.kind, verbatim: the name the book was configured under. It is the join key v_quant_vs_live uses (with as_of), so it is kept next to the objective label. Never live_book (those are not projected as Portfolios)." .
# --- BenchmarkObservation (T-108, D11) ---
:quantPortfolio a owl:ObjectProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :BenchmarkObservation ; rdfs:range :Portfolio ;
    rdfs:comment "The Portfolio the number is about: a BENCHMARK book, or the LIVE book for the performance numbers upstream measured on its live_book snapshot." .
:quantMetric a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :BenchmarkObservation ; rdfs:range xsd:string ;
    rdfs:comment "Upstream's metric name, verbatim; no vocabulary is imposed, but T-109 found these: v_quant_portfolio expected_return, expected_vol, sharpe; v_quant_benchmark_performance realized_return, cumulative_return, benchmark_return, active_return; v_quant_vs_live active_weight. Not projected: n_positions (a count), rf_annual (an input), turnover (not set by upstream's writer)." .
:quantValue a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :BenchmarkObservation ; rdfs:range xsd:decimal ;
    rdfs:comment "Upstream's value, in its own unit." .
:quantUnit a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :BenchmarkObservation ; rdfs:range xsd:string ;
    rdfs:comment "Optional unit of quantValue. Values are never converted. Vocabulary (T-109): fraction (0.05 = 5%, no time basis), fraction_annual (expected_return, expected_vol: annualised), fraction_daily (realized_return, benchmark_return, active_return: one trading day), ratio (sharpe: unitless), count. Only quant_position weights are scaled by the projection, x100, because weightPct is 0-100." .
:quantAsset a owl:ObjectProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :BenchmarkObservation ; rdfs:range :Asset ;
    rdfs:comment "Only for per-asset numbers (active weight vs the live book); absent for whole-book metrics." .
:quantBenchmark a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :BenchmarkObservation ; rdfs:range xsd:string ;
    rdfs:comment "Optional. The reference index a performance number is measured against (v_quant_benchmark_performance.benchmark, e.g. bench-v2 or SPY_TR), verbatim. benchmark_return and active_return are meaningless without it." .
:quantAsOf a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :BenchmarkObservation ; rdfs:range xsd:date ;
    rdfs:comment "Optional date the number refers to: v_quant_portfolio.as_of for a book metric, v_quant_vs_live.as_of for an active weight, v_quant_benchmark_performance.date for a performance row (T-109). Immutable: a recompute is a new individual." .
:weightPct     a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :PortfolioPosition ; rdfs:range xsd:decimal .

# --- PriceObservation (derived daily summary only) ---
:observationDate  a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :PriceObservation ; rdfs:range xsd:date .
:closePrice       a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :PriceObservation ; rdfs:range xsd:decimal .
:dailyReturnPct   a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :PriceObservation ; rdfs:range xsd:decimal .
:atr14            a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :PriceObservation ; rdfs:range xsd:decimal .

# --- AttractivenessSnapshot / AttractivenessWeightScheme / WeightComponent (added 2026-08-13) ---
:attractivenessScore a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :AttractivenessSnapshot ; rdfs:range xsd:decimal  .
:computedAt a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :Observation ; rdfs:range xsd:dateTime ;
    rdfs:comment "When the row/text was computed. On an AttractivenessSnapshot, FundamentalMetricSet or FundamentalAssessment. It is not the as-of filter; use availableAt." .
:schemeId a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :AttractivenessWeightScheme ; rdfs:range xsd:string .
:weightMetricName a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :WeightComponent ; rdfs:range xsd:string ;
    rdfs:comment "Matches a ScoreSnapshot.metricType value. Named distinctly from ThresholdComparison's metricName to avoid a shared-property domain clash (see ObservationSnapshot's rationale)." .
:weightValue a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :WeightComponent ; rdfs:range xsd:decimal .
:inverted a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :WeightComponent ; rdfs:range xsd:boolean ;
    rdfs:comment "Design history (2026-08-13 formula, not computed here since T-155): true for risk-oriented metrics that would be read as (1 - normalizedScore) before weighting. Optional since T-121: upstream has no counterpart (D13 item 4), so it is emitted for no upstream scheme and kept only on WeightScheme_v1." .
:cycleDate a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:range xsd:date ;
    rdfs:comment "T-121: the date of the cycle_run that recorded the individual; on an AttractivenessWeightScheme, upstream v_weight_scheme.cycle_date verbatim. No rdfs:domain, like :runId/:runAsOf: upstream also carries cycle_date on v_cycle_ranking, v_cycle_ranking_component, v_weight_component and v_sector_aggregate_snapshot, and a domain would type any such individual as a scheme (contradicting AllDisjointClasses); each class that uses it constrains it in its shape. An observation date, NOT valid time: a per-run scheme is never closed, and its lack of validTo does not mean 'still active'. Distinct from :runAsOf (the run log's as_of, v_cycle_run), which T-151's checks compare it with but which this repo does not assume equal." .
:bookWeightingRule a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :AttractivenessWeightScheme ; rdfs:range xsd:string  .
:topN a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :AttractivenessWeightScheme ; rdfs:range xsd:integer  .
:maxNameWeight a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :AttractivenessWeightScheme ; rdfs:range xsd:decimal  .
:maxSectorWeight a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :AttractivenessWeightScheme ; rdfs:range xsd:decimal  .
:softVetoPenalty a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :AttractivenessWeightScheme ; rdfs:range xsd:decimal  .

# --- backtest selection side (Work item 26, T-322): rank/selection/weights ---
:rankPosition a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :AttractivenessSnapshot ; rdfs:range xsd:integer  .
:selectedForBook a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :AttractivenessSnapshot ; rdfs:range xsd:boolean  .
:vetoedAtRanking a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :AttractivenessSnapshot ; rdfs:range xsd:boolean ;
    rdfs:comment "Upstream v_cycle_ranking.vetoed: true only for a HARD veto or the UNSCORED/UNPRICED gaps, never for a SOFT veto alone. The stints themselves are :Veto individuals (v_veto)." .
:targetWeight a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :AttractivenessSnapshot ; rdfs:range xsd:decimal  .
:vetoRulesJson a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :AttractivenessSnapshot ; rdfs:range xsd:string ;
    rdfs:comment "Upstream v_cycle_ranking.veto_rules_json verbatim: the rule ids/markers that applied at that ranking, including UNSCORED and UNPRICED, which have no :Veto row. A JSON string, like :paramsJson; never parsed or recomputed here. It names rules only, not price values." .
:componentValue a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :WeightComponent ; rdfs:range xsd:decimal  .

:cycleType a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :SelectionCycle ; rdfs:range xsd:string ;
    rdfs:comment "Upstream v_cycle_run.cycle_type: SELECTION, MONITORING, ENTITY_RESOLUTION or REPLAY. A backtest database's cycle runs are REPLAY by construction, which is why the backtest source check reads v_book.run_status rather than the live REPLAY refusal (T-320)." .
:rankingTicker a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :AttractivenessSnapshot ; rdfs:range xsd:string ;
    rdfs:comment "Upstream v_cycle_ranking.ticker, always written so a row survives when the shared universe database does not know the ticker; :attractivenessOfAsset is added only when it does. The reports agent must not treat this literal as proof of an :Asset link." .
:vetoTicker a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :Veto ; rdfs:range xsd:string ;
    rdfs:comment "Upstream v_veto.ticker, always written so a backtest veto survives when the shared universe database does not know the ticker; :vetoOfAsset is added only when it does." .

#################################################################
# 3.1 CONTRACT v18 DATATYPE PROPERTIES (T-206, 2026-11-01)
#
# Properties shared across classes have NO rdfs:domain, the :runId
# pattern (T-106): a domain would RDFS-entail one new class on an
# individual of another and clash with AllDisjointClasses. The
# shared ones are :bookId, :backtestRunId, :armCode, :windowId,
# :runLabel, :knowledgeDate, :status, :decisionDate, :guardTicker, :guardLayer,
# :segment, :handle, :startedAt, :finishedAt and :runKind. Per-class
# fields carry a domain.
#
# Nullability follows the m015/m016/m018 DDL and the handoff §3.3:
# only columns the views guarantee non-null are required in SHACL
# (shapes.ttl). :drawdown, :costReturn and :maxDrawdown have no sign
# or range constraint because the handoff states no sign convention.
#################################################################

# --- shared across the m018 views (no rdfs:domain) ---
:bookId a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:range xsd:integer ;
    rdfs:comment "v_book.book_id and the book_id of the five other m018 views that carry it. No rdfs:domain: shared across StrategyBook, BookRebalance, GuardAction, BookWeightDaily, BookDailyPerformance and PortfolioPeriodSummary." .
:backtestRunId a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:range xsd:integer ;
    rdfs:comment "v_*.backtest_run_id. No rdfs:domain: shared across all eight m018 classes and the :BacktestRun metadata class (Work item 33). The m018 literal remains the link from a book or a test to its run; :BacktestRun is the labelled run artefact, not a per-row node." .
:armCode a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:range xsd:string ;
    rdfs:comment "MARKOWITZ_BASE | TOPN_MV_NOGUARD | TOPN_MV_GUARD_NO_NLP | TOPN_MV_GUARD | MARKOWITZ_BASE_GUARD | MARKOWITZ_MV. No rdfs:domain: shared across StrategyBook, BookRebalance, GuardAction, BookWeightDaily, BookDailyPerformance and PortfolioPeriodSummary. MARKOWITZ_MV is the external mean-variance base book (Work item 44), summary-only. SHACL sh:in." .
:windowId a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:range xsd:string ;
    rdfs:comment "P<number> or H<number> (P1, P2, P3, H1, H2, H3, …; T-234 opened the vocabulary and Work item 33 added H<number> for the holdout windows). No rdfs:domain: shared across StrategyBook, GuardAlert, BookDailyPerformance, PortfolioPeriodSummary, BacktestTest and BacktestRun. SHACL sh:pattern ^[PH][0-9]+$: a typo in the letter or digits is no longer caught, only the P<number>/H<number> shape." .
:knowledgeDate a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:range xsd:date ;
    rdfs:comment "The date the m018 row became known (v_* knowledge_date, the view's own date or the run's created_at date). No rdfs:domain: every m018 individual carries it, so a knowledgeDate <= D query works uniformly (handoff checklist 3). It is not valid time and not a replacement for :knowledgeDate-less m015/m016 rows." .
:status a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:range xsd:string ;
    rdfs:comment "No rdfs:domain: shared by OrchestratorRun/OrchestratorStep, BookRebalance and GuardAction, whose vocabularies differ. Open per class; GuardActionShape closes its values to APPLIED | ARM_DISABLED | NOT_HELD | SUPERSEDED." .
:decisionDate a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:range xsd:date ;
    rdfs:comment "The session close at which the decision was made. No rdfs:domain: shared by BookRebalance (the close before execution_date) and GuardAction (the alert's session)." .
:guardTicker a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:range xsd:string ;
    rdfs:comment "Optional on GuardAlert and GuardAction (v_*.ticker). No rdfs:domain, so the two classes share it without entailment. NULL on layers 3/4." .
:guardLayer a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:range xsd:integer ;
    rdfs:comment "T-206: 1..4, the GUARD protection layer. No rdfs:domain: it is the alert's v_guard_alert.layer and the GUARD RuleDefinition's layer. SHACL bounds it to 1..4 on both." .
:segment a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:range xsd:string ;
    rdfs:comment "P<number> or H<number> plus an optional lowercase sub-period suffix (P1, H1, P3, H2, P2a, P2b, H3, …; T-234 opened the vocabulary and Work item 33 added H<number>). No rdfs:domain: shared by PortfolioPeriodSummary and BacktestTest. SHACL sh:pattern ^[PH][0-9]+[a-z]?$." .
:runLabel a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:range xsd:string ;
    rdfs:comment "The operator's name for one backtest result family (--db LABEL=PATH; T-233), the one run identity the m018 views do not expose (no input hash, no parameters). [a-z][a-z0-9_]{1,31}: lowercase, 2-32 characters. No rdfs:domain: StrategyBook and BacktestTest share it, the two m018 classes with no book link, and BacktestRun, AggregatesSet, TrendFilterState and ReferenceReturn carry it directly; every other class reaches its label through its book. SHACL sh:pattern, the same one the CLI and the graph-name pattern enforce." .
:handle a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:range xsd:string ;
    rdfs:comment "v_orchestrator_run.handle, the uuid4 the run endpoints return; repeated on v_orchestrator_step from the joined run. No rdfs:domain." .
:startedAt a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:range xsd:dateTime ;
    rdfs:comment "Start time. No rdfs:domain: OrchestratorRun and OrchestratorStep share it. Optional on a step (the DDL allows NULL)." .
:finishedAt a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:range xsd:dateTime ;
    rdfs:comment "Finish time, optional. No rdfs:domain: OrchestratorRun and OrchestratorStep share it." .
:runKind a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:range xsd:string ;
    rdfs:comment "OrchestratorRun.kind (pipeline | pricing-agent | ...) and OrchestratorStep.run_kind (pricing | analysis | cycle | quant). Open vocabulary. No rdfs:domain." .

# --- BacktestRun / RunConfiguration (Work item 33) ---
:sourceFile a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :BacktestRun ; rdfs:range xsd:string ;
    rdfs:comment "The result file name from the distribution's SHA256SUMS (for example rule_P1.db), never an absolute path." .
:sourceSha256 a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :BacktestRun ; rdfs:range xsd:string ;
    rdfs:comment "The lowercase SHA-256 of :sourceFile exactly as SHA256SUMS records it (sha256sum format: 64 lowercase hex digits, two spaces, file name). Read verbatim, never recomputed here; SHACL enforces ^[0-9a-f]{64}$." .
:configCodeCommit a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :RunConfiguration ; rdfs:range xsd:string ;
    rdfs:comment "The code commit named by config_<label>.md (its code_commit field), verbatim." .
:configPr a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :RunConfiguration ; rdfs:range xsd:string ;
    rdfs:comment "The pull request named by config_<label>.md (its pr field), kept as a string, verbatim." .
:configResultsDoc a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :RunConfiguration ; rdfs:range xsd:string ;
    rdfs:comment "The results document named by config_<label>.md (its results_doc field), verbatim." .
:configId a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :RunConfiguration ; rdfs:range xsd:string ;
    rdfs:comment "Optional: the configuration id named by config_<label>.md (its config_id field, e.g. Y2), verbatim." .
:configStatus a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :RunConfiguration ; rdfs:range xsd:string ;
    rdfs:comment "Optional: the status line named by config_<label>.md (its status field), verbatim, including its quotes and parentheses when present." .

# --- AggregatesSet / TrendFilterState / ReferenceReturn (Work item 37) ---
# The row-property comments are the aggregates file's own dictionary text, verbatim (upstream
# asked that it not be rewritten). New names are used instead of :windowId/:decisionDate/
# :dateFrom/:maxDrawdown because those properties carry an rdfs:domain that would otherwise
# entail a disjoint class on these rows.
:aggregatesSourceFile a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :AggregatesSet ; rdfs:range xsd:string ;
    rdfs:comment "The aggregates file name from SHA256SUMS (aggregates_<label>.json), never an absolute path. Work item 37." .
:aggregatesSourceSha256 a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :AggregatesSet ; rdfs:range xsd:string ;
    rdfs:comment "The lowercase SHA-256 of :aggregatesSourceFile exactly as SHA256SUMS records it (64 lowercase hex digits, two spaces, file name). Read verbatim, never recomputed here; SHACL enforces ^[0-9a-f]{64}$." .
:aggregatesConfigId a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :AggregatesSet ; rdfs:range xsd:string ;
    rdfs:comment "The configuration id from the aggregates file (config_id, for example Y2), verbatim." .
:aggregatesRunDatabasesSource a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :AggregatesSet ; rdfs:range xsd:string ;
    rdfs:comment "The aggregates file's sources.run_databases text, verbatim." .
:aggregatesSpySource a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :AggregatesSet ; rdfs:range xsd:string ;
    rdfs:comment "The aggregates file's sources.spy_source text, verbatim. It names the source only; sources.spy_total_return_series_sha256 is never projected." .
:aggregatesSp500EwInternalSource a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :AggregatesSet ; rdfs:range xsd:string ;
    rdfs:comment "The aggregates file's sources.sp500_ew_internal text, verbatim." .
:aggregatesSet a owl:ObjectProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:range :AggregatesSet ;
    rdfs:comment "The per-label AggregatesSet a TrendFilterState or ReferenceReturn row belongs to. No rdfs:domain: both row classes share it, like :runLabel." .
:trendWindow a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :TrendFilterState ; rdfs:range xsd:string ;
    rdfs:comment """backtest window id (P1, H1, P3, H2, P2, H3)""" .
:trendDecisionDate a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :TrendFilterState ; rdfs:range xsd:date ;
    rdfs:comment """ISO date of the decision session (the close the filter reads); the same dates as v_book_rebalance.decision_date of the Top-N arms""" .
:trendState a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :TrendFilterState ; rdfs:range xsd:string  .
:cashFraction a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :TrendFilterState ; rdfs:range xsd:decimal  .
:appliesToArm a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :TrendFilterState ; rdfs:range xsd:string ;
    rdfs:comment "TOPN_MV_NOGUARD | TOPN_MV_GUARD_NO_NLP: the arms the trend filter applies to, read from trend_filter_applies_to_arms (the MARKOWITZ_* arms never use it). SHACL requires exactly these two values on every row." .
:returnWindow a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :ReferenceReturn ; rdfs:range xsd:string ;
    rdfs:comment """backtest window id""" .
:returnSegment a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :ReferenceReturn ; rdfs:range xsd:string ;
    rdfs:comment """reporting segment: the window itself, or P2a / P2b (cuts of P2)""" .
:referenceDateFrom a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :ReferenceReturn ; rdfs:range xsd:date ;
    rdfs:comment """ISO date of the segment's first session (the same as backtest_summary.date_from)""" .
:referenceDateTo a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :ReferenceReturn ; rdfs:range xsd:date ;
    rdfs:comment """ISO date of the segment's last session (the same as backtest_summary.date_to)""" .
:nSessions a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :ReferenceReturn ; rdfs:range xsd:integer  .
:referenceName a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :ReferenceReturn ; rdfs:range xsd:string  .
:referenceTotalReturn a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :ReferenceReturn ; rdfs:range xsd:decimal  .
:referenceMaxDrawdown a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :ReferenceReturn ; rdfs:range xsd:decimal  .

# --- OrchestratorRun / OrchestratorStep ---
:orchestratorRunId a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :OrchestratorRun ; rdfs:range xsd:integer ;
    rdfs:comment "v_orchestrator_run.run_id (orchestrator_run.id). The run's natural key." .
:settingsJson a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :OrchestratorRun ; rdfs:range xsd:string ;
    rdfs:comment "v_orchestrator_run.settings_json, the JSON object of the given settings, or absent when NULL. Optional." .
:surface a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :OrchestratorRun ; rdfs:range xsd:string ;
    rdfs:comment "v_orchestrator_run.surface ('http' | 'cli' in the DDL; open)." .
:stepName a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :OrchestratorStep ; rdfs:range xsd:string ;
    rdfs:comment "v_orchestrator_step.step, the T-011 step name." .
:ordinal a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :OrchestratorStep ; rdfs:range xsd:integer ;
    rdfs:comment "1-based position of the step in its run; part of the (orchestrator_run_id, ordinal) natural key." .
:argvJson a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :OrchestratorStep ; rdfs:range xsd:string ;
    rdfs:comment "v_orchestrator_step.argv_json: a JSON array without the interpreter path." .
:exitCode a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :OrchestratorStep ; rdfs:range xsd:integer ;
    rdfs:comment "Optional: v_orchestrator_step.exit_code, absent when NULL." .
:reason a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :OrchestratorStep ; rdfs:range xsd:string ;
    rdfs:comment "Optional: v_orchestrator_step.reason." .
:outputTail a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :OrchestratorStep ; rdfs:range xsd:string ;
    rdfs:comment "Optional: v_orchestrator_step.output_tail, a JSON array of the last 40 lines." .

# --- TickerHistory ---
:tickerHistoryCik a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :TickerHistory ; rdfs:range xsd:string ;
    rdfs:comment "v_ticker_history.cik. Named distinctly from :cikNumber (whose rdfs:domain is Asset) so a TickerHistory is not entailed to be an Asset." .
:historicalSymbol a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :TickerHistory ; rdfs:range xsd:string ;
    rdfs:comment "v_ticker_history.symbol: the symbol in use over the inclusive interval [validFrom, validTo]." .
:canonicalSymbol a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :TickerHistory ; rdfs:range xsd:string ;
    rdfs:comment "v_ticker_history.canonical_symbol: the CIK line's current ticker, the one every other view shows." .
:evidenceUrl a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :TickerHistory ; rdfs:range xsd:anyURI ;
    rdfs:comment "Optional: v_ticker_history.evidence_url. The m016 DDL marks it NOT NULL, but the task's v18 shape contract keeps it optional (the expectation file dropped its non-null rule after the P1/P2/P3 check)." .
:evidenceDate a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :TickerHistory ; rdfs:range xsd:date ;
    rdfs:comment "Optional: v_ticker_history.evidence_date, for the same reason as :evidenceUrl." .
:tickerHistoryRules a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :TickerHistory ; rdfs:range xsd:string ;
    rdfs:comment "Optional: v_ticker_history.rules (e.g. 'L-11;APP-10a'), a provenance tag read verbatim and never parsed." .

# --- StrategyBook ---
:runStatus a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :StrategyBook ; rdfs:range xsd:string ;
    rdfs:comment "v_book.run_status = backtest_run.status (running | completed | failed in the DDL; open). Distinct from :status." .
:objective a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :StrategyBook ; rdfs:range xsd:string ;
    rdfs:label "Registered optimization class"@en ;
    rdfs:label "Clasificación de optimización registrada"@es ;
    rdfs:comment "v_book.objective, upstream's strategy_book.objective, open and read verbatim. Upstream's _insert_books function writes it as a fixed literal per arm: 'min_var' for every optimized arm and 'equal_weight' for the benchmark SP500_EW_INTERNAL, independent of the run's satellite_weighting. The delivery's config_final.md describes a minimum-variance optimisation step that keeps at most 30 names, followed by minimum-CVaR weighting of those names, so the literal 'min_var' is NOT the weighting objective of the TOPN_MV_* books and must not be presented as such. Upstream confirmed (2026-11-09) that 'min_var' documents the minimum-variance selection stage; the final weights of the TOPN_MV_* books are minimum-CVaR. On the external MARKOWITZ_MV book the loader writes 'max_sharpe' as the registered class: the tangency portfolio maximises the Sharpe ratio; it is not an engine arm."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "v_book.objective, la etiqueta strategy_book.objective de upstream, abierta y leída verbatim. La función _insert_books de upstream la escribe como literal fijo por brazo: 'min_var' para todo brazo optimizado y 'equal_weight' para el benchmark SP500_EW_INTERNAL, independientemente de satellite_weighting de la corrida. El config_final.md de la entrega describe un paso de optimización de mínima varianza que mantiene como máximo 30 nombres, seguido de una ponderación por mínimo CVaR de esos nombres, así que el literal 'min_var' NO es la función objetivo de ponderación de los libros TOPN_MV_* y no debe presentarse como tal. Upstream confirmó (2026-11-09) que 'min_var' documenta la etapa de selección por mínima varianza; los pesos finales de los libros TOPN_MV_* son de mínimo CVaR. En el libro externo MARKOWITZ_MV el loader escribe 'max_sharpe' como clase registrada: la cartera tangente maximiza la razón de Sharpe; no es un brazo del motor."@es .
:dataSource a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :StrategyBook ; rdfs:range xsd:string ;
    rdfs:comment "Work item 44: the provenance label of a book computed outside the engine, read from the delivery's source string (e.g. 'independent simulator validated against the engine'). Optional and at most one; the engine arms carry no value." .
:excludeHardVetoed a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :StrategyBook ; rdfs:range xsd:boolean  .
:guardLayers a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :StrategyBook ; rdfs:range xsd:string ;
    rdfs:comment "v_book.guard_layers, the JSON list text verbatim. Optional: the DDL comment says '[]' on BASE/NOGUARD, but the completed P1/P2/P3 databases hold NULL there and '[1, 3, 4]' on the guard arms (TOPN_MV_GUARD_NO_NLP and MARKOWITZ_BASE_GUARD), so the shape does not require it and never parses it." .
:backtestStartDate a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :StrategyBook ; rdfs:range xsd:date ;
    rdfs:comment "v_book.d_start (backtest_run.d_start)." .
:backtestEndDate a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :StrategyBook ; rdfs:range xsd:date ;
    rdfs:comment "v_book.d_end (backtest_run.d_end)." .
:formationDate a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :StrategyBook ; rdfs:range xsd:date ;
    rdfs:comment "Optional: v_book.formation_date, the first execution whose cycle selection succeeded; NULL until then." .

# --- BookRebalance ---
:rebalanceId a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :BookRebalance ; rdfs:range xsd:integer ;
    rdfs:comment "v_book_rebalance.rebalance_id (book_rebalance.id)." .
:executionDate a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :BookRebalance ; rdfs:range xsd:date ;
    rdfs:comment "v_book_rebalance.execution_date: the NYSE session E_k = D1 + 21*k, one session after decision_date." .
:quantPortfolioId a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :BookRebalance ; rdfs:range xsd:integer ;
    rdfs:comment "Optional: v_book_rebalance.quant_portfolio_id, an upstream id. It is a literal, not a :Portfolio node: no v_quant_portfolio individual is minted by this class." .
:cycleRunId a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:range xsd:integer ;
    rdfs:comment "Upstream cycle_run id. No rdfs:domain (the :runId pattern): shared by BookRebalance (v_book_rebalance.cycle_run_id, NULL on MARKOWITZ_BASE), SelectionCycle (v_cycle_run.run_id) and AttractivenessWeightScheme (the run the blend belongs to), so the reports agent can join a rebalance to its ranking without a graph-specific convention." .
:riskModelId a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :BookRebalance ; rdfs:range xsd:integer ;
    rdfs:comment "Optional: v_book_rebalance.risk_model_id, an upstream id literal, not a node." .

# --- GuardAlert ---
:alertId a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :GuardAlert ; rdfs:range xsd:integer ;
    rdfs:comment "v_guard_alert.alert_id (guard_alert.id)." .
:alertDate a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :GuardAlert ; rdfs:range xsd:date ;
    rdfs:comment "v_guard_alert.date, the session close the alert was raised at." .
:alertValue a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :GuardAlert ; rdfs:range xsd:decimal ;
    rdfs:comment "Optional: v_guard_alert.value. Always NULL on layer 1 (per-asset returns are not published in the graph); :alertState is always populated, and :alertThreshold on every rule except the two Basing Points rules (Work item 33)." .
:alertThreshold a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :GuardAlert ; rdfs:range xsd:decimal ;
    rdfs:comment "v_guard_alert.threshold. Required for every alert except L1_BP_STOP/L1_BP_REENTRY, where it is the individual asset's stop price level and is therefore forbidden (Work item 33: upstream's licence does not allow redistributing it). L1_STOP_LOSS/L1_REENTRY keep their fixed parameter. SHACL enforces both sides." .
:alertState a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :GuardAlert ; rdfs:range xsd:string ;
    rdfs:comment "v_guard_alert.state: ENTER | EXIT | ACTIVE | COOLDOWN | SCALE. SHACL sh:in." .

# --- GuardAction ---
:actionId a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :GuardAction ; rdfs:range xsd:integer ;
    rdfs:comment "v_guard_action.action_id (guard_action.id)." .
:effectiveDate a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :GuardAction ; rdfs:range xsd:date ;
    rdfs:comment "v_guard_action.effective_date: the session the target applies to (t+1)." .
:weightBefore a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :GuardAction ; rdfs:range xsd:decimal ;
    rdfs:comment "Optional: v_guard_action.weight_before. NULL on layer 1 asset actions (masked) and on NOT_HELD; portfolio-level L3/L4 scale factors keep it." .
:weightAfter a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :GuardAction ; rdfs:range xsd:decimal ;
    rdfs:comment "Optional: v_guard_action.weight_after, the same nullability as :weightBefore." .

# --- BookWeightDaily ---
:weightDate a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :BookWeightDaily ; rdfs:range xsd:date ;
    rdfs:comment "v_book_weight_daily.date." .
:holdingKey a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :BookWeightDaily ; rdfs:range xsd:string ;
    rdfs:comment "v_book_weight_daily.holding_key: a ticker, or 'CASH' for the cash position. A CASH row has no :holdingAsset and must not require an Asset node." .
:holdingName a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :BookWeightDaily ; rdfs:range xsd:string ;
    rdfs:comment "Optional: v_book_weight_daily.holding_name; NULL when holding_key = 'CASH'." .
:markowitzTargetWeight a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :BookWeightDaily ; rdfs:range xsd:decimal ;
    rdfs:comment "Optional: v_book_weight_daily.markowitz_target_weight; NULL on ordinary sessions (only decision/execution dates expose targets)." .
:finalTargetWeight a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :BookWeightDaily ; rdfs:range xsd:decimal ;
    rdfs:comment "Optional: v_book_weight_daily.final_target_weight; the same ordinary-session masking as :markowitzTargetWeight. This is the portfolio weight a held name (or the SPY core/CASH) actually has on a decision/execution date; it is not the cycle ranking's :targetWeight over the 60-name candidate pool." .

# --- BookDailyPerformance ---
:performanceDate a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :BookDailyPerformance ; rdfs:range xsd:date ;
    rdfs:comment "v_book_daily_performance.date." .
:grossReturn a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :BookDailyPerformance ; rdfs:range xsd:decimal .
:turnover a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :BookDailyPerformance ; rdfs:range xsd:decimal .
:costReturn a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :BookDailyPerformance ; rdfs:range xsd:decimal  .
:netReturn a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :BookDailyPerformance ; rdfs:range xsd:decimal .
:nav a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :BookDailyPerformance ; rdfs:range xsd:decimal .
:drawdown a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :BookDailyPerformance ; rdfs:range xsd:decimal  .
:cashWeight a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :BookDailyPerformance ; rdfs:range xsd:decimal .
:nEquity a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :BookDailyPerformance ; rdfs:range xsd:integer .
:benchmarkReturn a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :BookDailyPerformance ; rdfs:range xsd:decimal  .

# --- PortfolioPeriodSummary ---
:dateFrom a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :PortfolioPeriodSummary ; rdfs:range xsd:date .
:dateTo a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :PortfolioPeriodSummary ; rdfs:range xsd:date .
:cumulativeReturn a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :PortfolioPeriodSummary ; rdfs:range xsd:decimal .
:annualizedReturn a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :PortfolioPeriodSummary ; rdfs:range xsd:decimal .
:annualizedVol a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :PortfolioPeriodSummary ; rdfs:range xsd:decimal .
:exPostSharpe a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :PortfolioPeriodSummary ; rdfs:range xsd:decimal .
:maxDrawdown a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :PortfolioPeriodSummary ; rdfs:range xsd:decimal  .
:totalTurnover a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :PortfolioPeriodSummary ; rdfs:range xsd:decimal .
:totalCostBps a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :PortfolioPeriodSummary ; rdfs:range xsd:decimal .
:nRebalances a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :PortfolioPeriodSummary ; rdfs:range xsd:integer .
:nGuardActions a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :PortfolioPeriodSummary ; rdfs:range xsd:integer .

# --- BacktestTest ---
:armA a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :BacktestTest ; rdfs:range xsd:string  .
:armB a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :BacktestTest ; rdfs:range xsd:string  .
:testName a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :BacktestTest ; rdfs:range xsd:string  .
:statistic a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :BacktestTest ; rdfs:range xsd:decimal .
:pValue a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :BacktestTest ; rdfs:range xsd:decimal .
:nObs a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :BacktestTest ; rdfs:range xsd:integer .
:paramsJson a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :BacktestTest ; rdfs:range xsd:string  .

#################################################################
# 4. OWL CARDINALITY RESTRICTIONS (semantic, complements SHACL's
# data-level validation in shapes.ttl — see schema/README.md for
# why the ontology carries both)
#################################################################

:RuleClause rdfs:subClassOf
    [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty :operand1 ; owl:cardinality 1 ] ,
    [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty :operand2 ; owl:cardinality 1 ] ,
    [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty :clauseType ; owl:cardinality 1 ] .

:RuleDefinition rdfs:subClassOf
    [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty :hasClause ; owl:cardinality 1 ] .

:RiskEvent rdfs:subClassOf
    [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty :backedBy ; owl:minCardinality 1 ] .

#################################################################
# Direct bilingual labels/comments for the schema terms in the glossary
# (Work item 43, T-754).
#################################################################

:StrategyBook rdfs:comment "One experimental arm of one backtest run in one window; a named pool of holdings."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Brazo experimental de una corrida de backtest en una ventana; un conjunto nombrado de tenencias."@es .

:GuardAlert rdfs:comment "One GUARD layer daily alert for one asset, with its rule, value, threshold and state."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Alerta diaria de una capa de GUARD para un activo, con su regla, valor, umbral y estado."@es .

:GuardAction rdfs:comment "The effect of one GUARD alert on one book for the next session."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Efecto de una alerta de GUARD sobre un libro para la sesión siguiente."@es .

:Veto rdfs:comment "A veto stint for one asset: the rules that fired and the interval raisedOn..clearedOn."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Período de veto de un activo: las reglas activadas y el intervalo raisedOn..clearedOn."@es .

:attractivenessScore rdfs:label "Combined score"@en ;
    rdfs:label "Puntaje combinado"@es ;
    rdfs:comment "Upstream blended_score / 100; higher is more attractive; it can be negative after soft penalties. The score is not the weight."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "blended_score de upstream / 100; mayor es más atractivo; puede ser negativo tras penalizaciones suaves. El puntaje no es el peso."@es .

:componentValue rdfs:label "Component value"@en ;
    rdfs:label "Valor del componente"@es ;
    rdfs:comment "The value one effective-weight component had for this asset in this cycle run, 0-100."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Valor que un componente de peso efectivo tuvo para este activo en esta corrida del ciclo, 0-100."@es .

:targetWeight rdfs:label "Candidate-pool target weight"@en ;
    rdfs:label "Peso objetivo en el grupo de candidatas"@es ;
    rdfs:comment "The cycle own weight over the 60-name candidate pool; not a portfolio weight."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Peso del ciclo sobre el grupo de 60 candidatas; no es un peso de cartera."@es .

:selectedForBook rdfs:label "Candidate-pool membership"@en ;
    rdfs:label "Pertenencia al grupo de candidatas"@es ;
    rdfs:comment "Membership of the 60-name candidate pool, not the at most 30 names held."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Pertenencia al grupo de 60 candidatas, no a los como máximo 30 nombres mantenidos."@es .

:rankPosition rdfs:label "Raw ranking position (includes excluded names)"@en ;
    rdfs:label "Posición en el ranking bruto (incluye excluidas)"@es ;
    rdfs:comment "Order by combined score over all classified members of the date, including vetoed names."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Orden por puntaje combinado sobre todos los miembros clasificados de la fecha, incluidas las vetadas."@es .

:nGuardActions rdfs:label "Number of GUARD actions"@en ;
    rdfs:label "Número de acciones de GUARD"@es ;
    rdfs:comment "Counts the actions GUARD executes on the book. In a book without GUARD, 0 means not applicable, not that GUARD did not act (MARKOWITZ_BASE, TOPN_MV_NOGUARD and MARKOWITZ_MV)."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Cuenta las acciones que GUARD ejecuta sobre el libro. En un libro sin GUARD, 0 significa no aplicable, no que GUARD no actuó (MARKOWITZ_BASE, TOPN_MV_NOGUARD y MARKOWITZ_MV)."@es .

:bookWeightingRule rdfs:label "Attractiveness book-weighting rule"@en ;
    rdfs:label "Regla de ponderación del libro de atractivo"@es ;
    rdfs:comment "Upstream scheme_id: the rule that turns the ranking into book weights (for example score_proportional or score_tilt). It belongs to the attractiveness score scheme, not to the portfolio, and is not satellite_weighting."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "scheme_id de upstream: la regla que convierte el ranking en pesos del libro (por ejemplo score_proportional o score_tilt). Pertenece al esquema de atractivo, no a la cartera, y no es satellite_weighting."@es .

:topN rdfs:label "Candidate-pool size"@en ;
    rdfs:label "Tamaño del grupo de candidatas"@es ;
    rdfs:comment "The size of the candidate pool (60 in the final backtest), not the cap of names actually held."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Tamaño del grupo de candidatas (60 en el backtest final), no el máximo de nombres mantenidos."@es .

:maxNameWeight rdfs:label "Maximum name weight"@en ;
    rdfs:label "Peso máximo por nombre"@es ;
    rdfs:comment "Fraction of the book; for example 0.05 = 5%."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Fracción del libro; por ejemplo 0,05 = 5 %."@es .

:maxSectorWeight rdfs:label "Maximum sector weight"@en ;
    rdfs:label "Peso máximo por sector"@es ;
    rdfs:comment "Fraction of the book; for example 0.30 = 30%."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Fracción del libro; por ejemplo 0,30 = 30 %."@es .

:softVetoPenalty rdfs:label "Soft-veto penalty"@en ;
    rdfs:label "Penalización por veto suave"@es ;
    rdfs:comment "Points of the upstream 0-100 blend charged once per active SOFT stint whose rule declares no penaltyPoints (15 by default); not a fraction."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Puntos de la mezcla 0-100 de upstream que se cargan una vez por período SOFT activo cuya regla no declara penaltyPoints (15 por defecto); no es una fracción."@es .

:excludeHardVetoed rdfs:label "Hard-veto filter in the shared covariance model (internal)"@en ;
    rdfs:label "Filtro de vetos duros en el modelo de covarianza compartido (interno)"@es ;
    rdfs:comment "It is 0 also in the System because the shared model includes vetoed names; the System excludes hard vetoes earlier, in the preselection. Never say the System does not exclude hard-vetoed companies."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Vale 0 también en el Sistema porque el modelo compartido incluye los vetados; el Sistema excluye los vetos duros antes, en la preselección. Nunca decir que el Sistema no excluye empresas con veto duro."@es .

:cashFraction rdfs:label "Trend-filter cash fraction"@en ;
    rdfs:label "Fracción en efectivo del filtro de tendencia"@es ;
    rdfs:comment "Fraction of the Top-N target moved to cash by the trend filter at this decision, held until the next decision date."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Fracción del objetivo Top-N movida a efectivo por el filtro de tendencia en esta decisión, mantenida hasta la siguiente fecha de decisión."@es .

:trendState rdfs:label "Trend-filter state"@en ;
    rdfs:label "Estado del filtro de tendencia"@es ;
    rdfs:comment "below, at_or_above or not_evaluable; no price level or mean is published."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "below, at_or_above o not_evaluable; no se publica nivel de precio ni media."@es .

:nRebalances rdfs:label "Number of rebalances"@en ;
    rdfs:label "Número de rebalanceos"@es ;
    rdfs:comment "Number of the window decisions whose execution date falls inside the segment."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Número de decisiones de la ventana cuya fecha de ejecución cae dentro del segmento."@es .

:totalTurnover rdfs:label "Total turnover"@en ;
    rdfs:label "Rotación total"@es ;
    rdfs:comment "Sum of the session turnover over the segment."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Suma de la rotación de las sesiones del segmento."@es .

:totalCostBps rdfs:label "Total transaction cost (basis points)"@en ;
    rdfs:label "Costo total de transacción (puntos básicos)"@es ;
    rdfs:comment "Sum of the session cost over the segment, in basis points."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Suma del costo de las sesiones del segmento, en puntos básicos."@es .

:maxDrawdown rdfs:label "Maximum drawdown"@en ;
    rdfs:label "Máxima caída"@es ;
    rdfs:comment "Largest fall from a running peak to the later trough before recovering the peak; not a daily loss."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Mayor caída desde un máximo acumulado hasta el mínimo posterior antes de recuperar el máximo; no es una pérdida diaria."@es .

:exPostSharpe rdfs:label "Ex-post Sharpe ratio"@en ;
    rdfs:label "Ratio de Sharpe ex-post"@es ;
    rdfs:comment "Mean excess return over its standard deviation, annualized; state the convention when reporting it."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Media del retorno en exceso sobre su desviación estándar, anualizada; indicar la convención al informarlo."@es .

:grossReturn rdfs:label "Gross return"@en ;
    rdfs:label "Retorno bruto"@es ;
    rdfs:comment "Daily book return before transaction costs."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Retorno diario del libro antes de costos de transacción."@es .

:netReturn rdfs:label "Net return"@en ;
    rdfs:label "Retorno neto"@es ;
    rdfs:comment "Daily book return after transaction costs."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Retorno diario del libro después de costos de transacción."@es .

:turnover rdfs:label "Turnover"@en ;
    rdfs:label "Rotación"@es ;
    rdfs:comment "Full sum of absolute equity-weight changes, not divided by two; cash does not count."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Suma completa de los cambios absolutos de peso en acciones, sin dividir entre dos; el efectivo no cuenta."@es .

:costReturn rdfs:label "Transaction cost return"@en ;
    rdfs:label "Retorno de costos de transacción"@es ;
    rdfs:comment "Per-session cost as a return fraction."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Costo por sesión como fracción de retorno."@es .

:referenceName rdfs:label "Reference name"@en ;
    rdfs:label "Nombre de la referencia"@es ;
    rdfs:comment "SPY (total return, dividends reinvested) or SP500_EW_INTERNAL."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "SPY (retorno total, dividendos reinvertidos) o SP500_EW_INTERNAL."@es .

:referenceTotalReturn rdfs:label "Reference total return"@en ;
    rdfs:label "Retorno total de la referencia"@es ;
    rdfs:comment "prod(1 + r_t) - 1 over the segment sessions, as a fraction."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "prod(1 + r_t) - 1 sobre las sesiones del segmento, como fracción."@es .

:referenceMaxDrawdown rdfs:label "Reference maximum drawdown"@en ;
    rdfs:label "Máxima caída de la referencia"@es ;
    rdfs:comment "max_t(1 - NAV_t / max(1, NAV_1..NAV_t)), positive fraction."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "max_t(1 - NAV_t / max(1, NAV_1..NAV_t)), fracción positiva."@es .

:nSessions rdfs:label "Number of sessions"@en ;
    rdfs:label "Número de sesiones"@es ;
    rdfs:comment "Number of sessions in the segment."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Número de sesiones del segmento."@es .

:dateFrom rdfs:label "Segment start date"@en ;
    rdfs:label "Fecha de inicio del segmento"@es ;
    rdfs:comment "First session date of the segment."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Primera fecha de sesión del segmento."@es .

:dateTo rdfs:label "Segment end date"@en ;
    rdfs:label "Fecha de fin del segmento"@es ;
    rdfs:comment "Last session date of the segment."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Última fecha de sesión del segmento."@es .

#################################################################
# Work item 45 — fundamentals block C (T-811/T-812)
# The 35 metric properties are the loaded vocabulary. The absolute
# price-derived names (market_capitalization, enterprise_value) and
# value_inputs have no property here, so the structural mask holds;
# the three valuation yields are skipped per masked asset by the loader.
#################################################################

:FundamentalMetricSet
    a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Fundamental metric set"@en ;
    rdfs:label "Conjunto de métricas fundamentales"@es ;
    skos:definition "Las razones calculadas para un informe de la SEC: un individuo por informe, con las 35 métricas cargadas (las 31 de operación, liquidez, apalancamiento, eficiencia, crecimiento, flujo de caja, ROIC y CAGR, más los tres rendimientos de valoración y utility_cash_coverage_3y). La capitalización de mercado, el valor de empresa y value_inputs no están representados."@es ;
    rdfs:comment "The ratios computed for one SEC filing: one individual per filing, with the 35 loaded metrics (the 31 operating, liquidity, leverage, efficiency, growth, cashflow, ROIC and CAGR metrics plus the three valuation yields and utility_cash_coverage_3y). Market capitalization, enterprise value and value_inputs are not represented."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Las razones calculadas para un informe de la SEC: un individuo por informe, con las 35 métricas cargadas (las 31 de operación, liquidez, apalancamiento, eficiencia, crecimiento, flujo de caja, ROIC y CAGR, más los tres rendimientos de valoración y utility_cash_coverage_3y). La capitalización de mercado, el valor de empresa y value_inputs no están representados."@es .

:FundamentalAssessment
    a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Fundamental assessment"@en ;
    rdfs:label "Evaluación fundamental"@es ;
    skos:definition "La evaluación narrativa de un informe: puntaje, calificación, narrativa generada, fortalezas y riesgos, con procedencia explícita del modelo. El texto es una interpretación generada, no un hecho verificado del informe."@es ;
    rdfs:comment "The narrative assessment of one filing: score, rating, generated narrative, strengths and risks, with explicit model provenance. The text is generated interpretation, not a verified filing fact."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "La evaluación narrativa de un informe: puntaje, calificación, narrativa generada, fortalezas y riesgos, con procedencia explícita del modelo. El texto es una interpretación generada, no un hecho verificado del informe."@es .

:FundamentalMetricSet rdfs:subClassOf :Observation .
:FundamentalAssessment rdfs:subClassOf :Observation .

:filingId a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :SECFiling ; rdfs:range xsd:integer ;
    rdfs:label "Filing id"@en ; rdfs:label "Id del informe"@es ;
    rdfs:comment "The delivery's integer filing_id; stable within the delivery and the key of the filing individual."@en ; rdfs:comment "El filing_id entero de la entrega; estable dentro de la entrega y clave del individuo del informe."@es .

:periodEnd a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :SECFiling ; rdfs:range xsd:date ;
    rdfs:label "Period end"@en ; rdfs:label "Fin del período"@es ;
    rdfs:comment "The fiscal period end date the filing reports; it is the event time of its metrics and assessment."@en ; rdfs:comment "La fecha de fin del período fiscal que reporta el informe; es el tiempo del evento de sus métricas y evaluación."@es .

:fiscalYear a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :SECFiling ; rdfs:range xsd:integer ;
    rdfs:label "Fiscal year"@en ; rdfs:label "Año fiscal"@es ;
    rdfs:comment "The fiscal year of the filing, as delivered."@en ; rdfs:comment "El año fiscal del informe, tal como se entrega."@es .

:fiscalPeriod a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :SECFiling ; rdfs:range xsd:string ;
    rdfs:label "Fiscal period"@en ; rdfs:label "Período fiscal"@es ;
    rdfs:comment "The fiscal period label, for example 2022Q1 or FY, as delivered."@en ; rdfs:comment "La etiqueta del período fiscal, por ejemplo 2022Q1 o FY, tal como se entrega."@es .

:metricSetOfFiling a owl:ObjectProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :FundamentalMetricSet ; rdfs:range :SECFiling ;
    rdfs:label "Metric set of filing"@en ; rdfs:label "Conjunto de métricas del informe"@es ;
    rdfs:comment "Links a fundamental metric set to the SEC filing it describes; one metric set per filing."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Vincula un conjunto de métricas fundamentales con el informe de la SEC que describe; un conjunto por informe."@es .

:assetTurnover a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :FundamentalMetricSet ; rdfs:range xsd:decimal ;
    rdfs:label "Asset turnover"@en ; rdfs:label "Rotación de activos"@es ;
    rdfs:comment "Revenue divided by average total assets; times (x). Read verbatim from the delivery; absent when the source value is null."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Ingresos divididos entre los activos totales promedio; veces (x). Leído verbatim de la entrega; ausente cuando el valor de origen es nulo."@es .

:capexIntensity a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :FundamentalMetricSet ; rdfs:range xsd:decimal ;
    rdfs:label "Capex intensity"@en ; rdfs:label "Intensidad de capex"@es ;
    rdfs:comment "Capital expenditure divided by revenue; fraction. Read verbatim from the delivery; absent when the source value is null."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Inversión de capital dividida entre los ingresos; fracción. Leído verbatim de la entrega; ausente cuando el valor de origen es nulo."@es .

:cashRatio a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :FundamentalMetricSet ; rdfs:range xsd:decimal ;
    rdfs:label "Cash ratio"@en ; rdfs:label "Ratio de caja"@es ;
    rdfs:comment "Cash and cash equivalents divided by current liabilities; times. Read verbatim from the delivery; absent when the source value is null."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Efectivo y equivalentes divididos entre los pasivos corrientes; veces. Leído verbatim de la entrega; ausente cuando el valor de origen es nulo."@es .

:currentRatio a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :FundamentalMetricSet ; rdfs:range xsd:decimal ;
    rdfs:label "Current ratio"@en ; rdfs:label "Ratio corriente"@es ;
    rdfs:comment "Current assets divided by current liabilities; times. Read verbatim from the delivery; absent when the source value is null."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Activos corrientes divididos entre pasivos corrientes; veces. Leído verbatim de la entrega; ausente cuando el valor de origen es nulo."@es .

:debtToAssets a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :FundamentalMetricSet ; rdfs:range xsd:decimal ;
    rdfs:label "Debt to assets"@en ; rdfs:label "Deuda sobre activos"@es ;
    rdfs:comment "Total debt divided by total assets; fraction. Read verbatim from the delivery; absent when the source value is null."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Deuda total dividida entre los activos totales; fracción. Leído verbatim de la entrega; ausente cuando el valor de origen es nulo."@es .

:debtToEquity a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :FundamentalMetricSet ; rdfs:range xsd:decimal ;
    rdfs:label "Debt to equity"@en ; rdfs:label "Deuda sobre patrimonio"@es ;
    rdfs:comment "Total debt divided by shareholders' equity; times. Read verbatim from the delivery; absent when the source value is null."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Deuda total dividida entre el patrimonio de los accionistas; veces. Leído verbatim de la entrega; ausente cuando el valor de origen es nulo."@es .

:ebitda a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :FundamentalMetricSet ; rdfs:range xsd:decimal ;
    rdfs:label "EBITDA"@en ; rdfs:label "EBITDA"@es ;
    rdfs:comment "Earnings before interest, taxes, depreciation and amortization; USD. Read verbatim from the delivery; absent when the source value is null."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Ganancias antes de intereses, impuestos, depreciación y amortización; USD. Leído verbatim de la entrega; ausente cuando el valor de origen es nulo."@es .

:effectiveTaxRate a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :FundamentalMetricSet ; rdfs:range xsd:decimal ;
    rdfs:label "Effective tax rate"@en ; rdfs:label "Tasa impositiva efectiva"@es ;
    rdfs:comment "Income tax expense divided by pre-tax income; fraction. Read verbatim from the delivery; absent when the source value is null."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Gasto por impuesto a la renta dividido entre la utilidad antes de impuestos; fracción. Leído verbatim de la entrega; ausente cuando el valor de origen es nulo."@es .

:freeCashFlowConversion a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :FundamentalMetricSet ; rdfs:range xsd:decimal ;
    rdfs:label "Free cash flow conversion"@en ; rdfs:label "Conversión de flujo de caja libre"@es ;
    rdfs:comment "Free cash flow divided by net income; times. Read verbatim from the delivery; absent when the source value is null."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Flujo de caja libre dividido entre la utilidad neta; veces. Leído verbatim de la entrega; ausente cuando el valor de origen es nulo."@es .

:freeCashFlowGrowth a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :FundamentalMetricSet ; rdfs:range xsd:decimal ;
    rdfs:label "Free cash flow growth"@en ; rdfs:label "Crecimiento del flujo de caja libre"@es ;
    rdfs:comment "Year-over-year growth of free cash flow; fraction. Read verbatim from the delivery; absent when the source value is null."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Crecimiento interanual del flujo de caja libre; fracción. Leído verbatim de la entrega; ausente cuando el valor de origen es nulo."@es .

:freeCashFlowMargin a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :FundamentalMetricSet ; rdfs:range xsd:decimal ;
    rdfs:label "Free cash flow margin"@en ; rdfs:label "Margen de flujo de caja libre"@es ;
    rdfs:comment "Free cash flow divided by revenue; fraction. Read verbatim from the delivery; absent when the source value is null."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Flujo de caja libre dividido entre los ingresos; fracción. Leído verbatim de la entrega; ausente cuando el valor de origen es nulo."@es .

:grossMargin a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :FundamentalMetricSet ; rdfs:range xsd:decimal ;
    rdfs:label "Gross margin"@en ; rdfs:label "Margen bruto"@es ;
    rdfs:comment "Gross profit divided by revenue; fraction. Read verbatim from the delivery; absent when the source value is null."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Utilidad bruta dividida entre los ingresos; fracción. Leído verbatim de la entrega; ausente cuando el valor de origen es nulo."@es .

:interestCoverage a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :FundamentalMetricSet ; rdfs:range xsd:decimal ;
    rdfs:label "Interest coverage"@en ; rdfs:label "Cobertura de intereses"@es ;
    rdfs:comment "EBIT divided by interest expense; times. Read verbatim from the delivery; absent when the source value is null."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "EBIT dividido entre el gasto por intereses; veces. Leído verbatim de la entrega; ausente cuando el valor de origen es nulo."@es .

:inventoryTurnover a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :FundamentalMetricSet ; rdfs:range xsd:decimal ;
    rdfs:label "Inventory turnover"@en ; rdfs:label "Rotación de inventario"@es ;
    rdfs:comment "Cost of goods sold divided by average inventory; times. Read verbatim from the delivery; absent when the source value is null."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Costo de los bienes vendidos dividido entre el inventario promedio; veces. Leído verbatim de la entrega; ausente cuando el valor de origen es nulo."@es .

:netDebtToEbitda a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :FundamentalMetricSet ; rdfs:range xsd:decimal ;
    rdfs:label "Net debt to EBITDA"@en ; rdfs:label "Deuda neta sobre EBITDA"@es ;
    rdfs:comment "Net debt divided by EBITDA; times. Read verbatim from the delivery; absent when the source value is null."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Deuda neta dividida entre EBITDA; veces. Leído verbatim de la entrega; ausente cuando el valor de origen es nulo."@es .

:netIncomeCagr a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :FundamentalMetricSet ; rdfs:range xsd:decimal ;
    rdfs:label "Net income CAGR"@en ; rdfs:label "CAGR de la utilidad neta"@es ;
    rdfs:comment "Compound annual growth rate of net income; fraction. Read verbatim from the delivery; absent when the source value is null."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Tasa compuesta de crecimiento anual de la utilidad neta; fracción. Leído verbatim de la entrega; ausente cuando el valor de origen es nulo."@es .

:netIncomeGrowth a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :FundamentalMetricSet ; rdfs:range xsd:decimal ;
    rdfs:label "Net income growth"@en ; rdfs:label "Crecimiento de la utilidad neta"@es ;
    rdfs:comment "Year-over-year growth of net income; fraction. Read verbatim from the delivery; absent when the source value is null."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Crecimiento interanual de la utilidad neta; fracción. Leído verbatim de la entrega; ausente cuando el valor de origen es nulo."@es .

:netMargin a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :FundamentalMetricSet ; rdfs:range xsd:decimal ;
    rdfs:label "Net margin"@en ; rdfs:label "Margen neto"@es ;
    rdfs:comment "Net income divided by revenue; fraction. Read verbatim from the delivery; absent when the source value is null."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Utilidad neta dividida entre los ingresos; fracción. Leído verbatim de la entrega; ausente cuando el valor de origen es nulo."@es .

:nopat a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :FundamentalMetricSet ; rdfs:range xsd:decimal ;
    rdfs:label "NOPAT"@en ; rdfs:label "NOPAT"@es ;
    rdfs:comment "Net operating profit after tax; USD. Read verbatim from the delivery; absent when the source value is null."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Utilidad operativa neta después de impuestos; USD. Leído verbatim de la entrega; ausente cuando el valor de origen es nulo."@es .

:operatingCashFlowCagr a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :FundamentalMetricSet ; rdfs:range xsd:decimal ;
    rdfs:label "Operating cash flow CAGR"@en ; rdfs:label "CAGR del flujo de caja operativo"@es ;
    rdfs:comment "Compound annual growth rate of operating cash flow; fraction. Read verbatim from the delivery; absent when the source value is null."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Tasa compuesta de crecimiento anual del flujo de caja operativo; fracción. Leído verbatim de la entrega; ausente cuando el valor de origen es nulo."@es .

:operatingCashFlowMargin a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :FundamentalMetricSet ; rdfs:range xsd:decimal ;
    rdfs:label "Operating cash flow margin"@en ; rdfs:label "Margen de flujo de caja operativo"@es ;
    rdfs:comment "Operating cash flow divided by revenue; fraction. Read verbatim from the delivery; absent when the source value is null."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Flujo de caja operativo dividido entre los ingresos; fracción. Leído verbatim de la entrega; ausente cuando el valor de origen es nulo."@es .

:operatingIncomeGrowth a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :FundamentalMetricSet ; rdfs:range xsd:decimal ;
    rdfs:label "Operating income growth"@en ; rdfs:label "Crecimiento de la utilidad operativa"@es ;
    rdfs:comment "Year-over-year growth of operating income; fraction. Read verbatim from the delivery; absent when the source value is null."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Crecimiento interanual de la utilidad operativa; fracción. Leído verbatim de la entrega; ausente cuando el valor de origen es nulo."@es .

:operatingMargin a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :FundamentalMetricSet ; rdfs:range xsd:decimal ;
    rdfs:label "Operating margin"@en ; rdfs:label "Margen operativo"@es ;
    rdfs:comment "Operating income divided by revenue; fraction. Read verbatim from the delivery; absent when the source value is null."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Utilidad operativa dividida entre los ingresos; fracción. Leído verbatim de la entrega; ausente cuando el valor de origen es nulo."@es .

:quickRatio a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :FundamentalMetricSet ; rdfs:range xsd:decimal ;
    rdfs:label "Quick ratio"@en ; rdfs:label "Ratio rápido"@es ;
    rdfs:comment "(Current assets minus inventory) divided by current liabilities; times. Read verbatim from the delivery; absent when the source value is null."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "(Activos corrientes menos inventario) divididos entre pasivos corrientes; veces. Leído verbatim de la entrega; ausente cuando el valor de origen es nulo."@es .

:receivablesTurnover a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :FundamentalMetricSet ; rdfs:range xsd:decimal ;
    rdfs:label "Receivables turnover"@en ; rdfs:label "Rotación de cuentas por cobrar"@es ;
    rdfs:comment "Revenue divided by average accounts receivable; times. Read verbatim from the delivery; absent when the source value is null."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Ingresos divididos entre las cuentas por cobrar promedio; veces. Leído verbatim de la entrega; ausente cuando el valor de origen es nulo."@es .

:returnOnAssets a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :FundamentalMetricSet ; rdfs:range xsd:decimal ;
    rdfs:label "Return on assets"@en ; rdfs:label "Retorno sobre activos"@es ;
    rdfs:comment "Net income divided by average total assets; fraction. Read verbatim from the delivery; absent when the source value is null."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Utilidad neta dividida entre los activos totales promedio; fracción. Leído verbatim de la entrega; ausente cuando el valor de origen es nulo."@es .

:returnOnEquity a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :FundamentalMetricSet ; rdfs:range xsd:decimal ;
    rdfs:label "Return on equity"@en ; rdfs:label "Retorno sobre patrimonio"@es ;
    rdfs:comment "Net income divided by average shareholders' equity; fraction. Read verbatim from the delivery; absent when the source value is null."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Utilidad neta dividida entre el patrimonio promedio de los accionistas; fracción. Leído verbatim de la entrega; ausente cuando el valor de origen es nulo."@es .

:returnOnInvestedCapital a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :FundamentalMetricSet ; rdfs:range xsd:decimal ;
    rdfs:label "Return on invested capital"@en ; rdfs:label "Retorno sobre el capital invertido"@es ;
    rdfs:comment "NOPAT divided by invested capital; fraction. Read verbatim from the delivery; absent when the source value is null."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "NOPAT dividido entre el capital invertido; fracción. Leído verbatim de la entrega; ausente cuando el valor de origen es nulo."@es .

:returnOnInvestedCapitalEffectiveRate a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :FundamentalMetricSet ; rdfs:range xsd:decimal ;
    rdfs:label "Return on invested capital (effective tax rate)"@en ; rdfs:label "Retorno sobre el capital invertido (tasa impositiva efectiva)"@es ;
    rdfs:comment "ROIC computed with the effective tax rate; fraction. Read verbatim from the delivery; absent when the source value is null."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "ROIC calculado con la tasa impositiva efectiva; fracción. Leído verbatim de la entrega; ausente cuando el valor de origen es nulo."@es .

:revenueCagr a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :FundamentalMetricSet ; rdfs:range xsd:decimal ;
    rdfs:label "Revenue CAGR"@en ; rdfs:label "CAGR de los ingresos"@es ;
    rdfs:comment "Compound annual growth rate of revenue; fraction. Read verbatim from the delivery; absent when the source value is null."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Tasa compuesta de crecimiento anual de los ingresos; fracción. Leído verbatim de la entrega; ausente cuando el valor de origen es nulo."@es .

:revenueGrowth a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :FundamentalMetricSet ; rdfs:range xsd:decimal ;
    rdfs:label "Revenue growth"@en ; rdfs:label "Crecimiento de los ingresos"@es ;
    rdfs:comment "Year-over-year growth of revenue; fraction. Read verbatim from the delivery; absent when the source value is null."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Crecimiento interanual de los ingresos; fracción. Leído verbatim de la entrega; ausente cuando el valor de origen es nulo."@es .

:enterpriseFcfYield a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :FundamentalMetricSet ; rdfs:range xsd:decimal ;
    rdfs:label "Enterprise FCF yield"@en ; rdfs:label "Rendimiento del flujo de caja libre sobre el valor de empresa"@es ;
    rdfs:comment "Free cash flow divided by enterprise value; fraction. Read verbatim from the delivery; absent when the source value is null."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Flujo de caja libre dividido entre el valor de empresa; fracción. Leído verbatim de la entrega; ausente cuando el valor de origen es nulo."@es .

:freeCashFlowYield a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :FundamentalMetricSet ; rdfs:range xsd:decimal ;
    rdfs:label "Free cash flow yield"@en ; rdfs:label "Rendimiento del flujo de caja libre"@es ;
    rdfs:comment "Free cash flow divided by market capitalization; fraction. Read verbatim from the delivery; absent when the source value is null."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Flujo de caja libre dividido entre la capitalización de mercado; fracción. Leído verbatim de la entrega; ausente cuando el valor de origen es nulo."@es .

:sbcAdjustedFcfYield a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :FundamentalMetricSet ; rdfs:range xsd:decimal ;
    rdfs:label "SBC-adjusted FCF yield"@en ; rdfs:label "Rendimiento del flujo de caja libre ajustado por SBC"@es ;
    rdfs:comment "SBC-adjusted free cash flow divided by market capitalization; fraction. Read verbatim from the delivery; absent when the source value is null."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Flujo de caja libre ajustado por compensación en acciones dividido entre la capitalización de mercado; fracción. Leído verbatim de la entrega; ausente cuando el valor de origen es nulo."@es .

:utilityCashCoverage3y a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :FundamentalMetricSet ; rdfs:range xsd:decimal ;
    rdfs:label "Utility cash coverage (3 years)"@en ; rdfs:label "Cobertura de caja de utility (3 años)"@es ;
    rdfs:comment "Three-year operating cash flow coverage of debt for regulated utilities; fraction. Read verbatim from the delivery; absent when the source value is null."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Cobertura de la deuda con el flujo de caja operativo a tres años para utilities reguladas; fracción. Leído verbatim de la entrega; ausente cuando el valor de origen es nulo."@es .

:assessmentOfFiling a owl:ObjectProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :FundamentalAssessment ; rdfs:range :SECFiling ;
    rdfs:label "Assessment of filing"@en ; rdfs:label "Evaluación del informe"@es ;
    rdfs:comment "Links the assessment to the filing it assesses; one assessment per snapshot."@en ; rdfs:comment "Vincula la evaluación con el informe que evalúa; una evaluación por instantánea."@es .

:assessmentOfAsset a owl:ObjectProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :FundamentalAssessment ; rdfs:range :Asset ;
    rdfs:label "Assessment of asset"@en ; rdfs:label "Evaluación del activo"@es ;
    rdfs:comment "Links the assessment to its asset for one-hop asset queries; the filing already links the asset."@en ; rdfs:comment "Vincula la evaluación con su activo para consultas de un salto; el informe ya vincula el activo."@es .

:snapshotId a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :FundamentalAssessment ; rdfs:range xsd:integer ;
    rdfs:label "Snapshot id"@en ; rdfs:label "Id de la instantánea"@es ;
    rdfs:comment "The delivery's integer snapshot_id; stable within the delivery and the key of the assessment individual."@en ; rdfs:comment "El snapshot_id entero de la entrega; estable dentro de la entrega y clave del individuo de la evaluación."@es .

:scoreRaw0to100 a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :FundamentalAssessment ; rdfs:range xsd:decimal ;
    rdfs:label "Raw fundamental score (0-100)"@en ; rdfs:label "Puntaje fundamental bruto (0-100)"@es ;
    rdfs:comment "The assessment's score on the 0-100 scale, read verbatim; absent on the 129 rule-based rows. It is not a portfolio weight."@en ; rdfs:comment "El puntaje de la evaluación en la escala 0-100, leído verbatim; ausente en las 129 filas de regla. No es un peso de cartera."@es .

:rating a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :FundamentalAssessment ; rdfs:range xsd:string ;
    rdfs:label "Rating"@en ; rdfs:label "Calificación"@es ;
    rdfs:comment "The assessment's rating: bullish, neutral or bearish; absent on the rule-based rows."@en ; rdfs:comment "La calificación de la evaluación: bullish, neutral o bearish; ausente en las filas de regla."@es .

:narrative a owl:DatatypeProperty ; rdfs:domain :FundamentalAssessment ; rdfs:range xsd:string ;
    rdfs:label "Narrative"@en ; rdfs:label "Narrativa"@es ;
    rdfs:comment "The generated narrative text. It is model output or rule text, never a verified filing fact; read it with generatedByLanguageModel and provenanceNote."@en ; rdfs:comment "El texto narrativo generado. Es salida de un modelo o texto de regla, nunca un hecho verificado del informe; léalo con generatedByLanguageModel y provenanceNote."@es .

:strength a owl:DatatypeProperty ; rdfs:domain :FundamentalAssessment ; rdfs:range xsd:string ;
    rdfs:label "Strength"@en ; rdfs:label "Fortaleza"@es ;
    rdfs:comment "One generated strength statement; repeated on the assessment. Never a verified filing fact."@en ; rdfs:comment "Una afirmación de fortaleza generada; repetida en la evaluación. Nunca un hecho verificado del informe."@es .

:risk a owl:DatatypeProperty ; rdfs:domain :FundamentalAssessment ; rdfs:range xsd:string ;
    rdfs:label "Risk"@en ; rdfs:label "Riesgo"@es ;
    rdfs:comment "One generated risk statement; repeated on the assessment. Never a verified filing fact."@en ; rdfs:comment "Una afirmación de riesgo generada; repetida en la evaluación. Nunca un hecho verificado del informe."@es .

:model a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :FundamentalAssessment ; rdfs:range xsd:string ;
    rdfs:label "Model"@en ; rdfs:label "Modelo"@es ;
    rdfs:comment "The producing model label, for example DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash [thinking=disabled], or unscored-pillar-coverage-v1 for the fixed rule text."@en ; rdfs:comment "La etiqueta del modelo productor, por ejemplo DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash [thinking=disabled], o unscored-pillar-coverage-v1 para el texto fijo de la regla."@es .

:generatedByLanguageModel a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :FundamentalAssessment ; rdfs:range xsd:boolean ;
    rdfs:label "Generated by language model"@en ; rdfs:label "Generado por un modelo de lenguaje"@es ;
    rdfs:comment "True for the 9,896 model-generated assessments; false for the 129 fixed coverage-rule texts. It marks the text as generated, not a verified fact."@en ; rdfs:comment "True para las 9,896 evaluaciones generadas por un modelo; false para los 129 textos fijos de la regla de cobertura. Marca el texto como generado, no como un hecho verificado."@es .

:provenanceNote a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain :FundamentalAssessment ; rdfs:range xsd:string ;
    rdfs:label "Provenance note"@en ; rdfs:label "Nota de procedencia"@es ;
    rdfs:comment "The delivery's provenance text verbatim: generated by a language model from computed ratios; not a verified fact (true), or rule-based text: no fundamental score (coverage rule); not generated by a model (false)."@en ; rdfs:comment "El texto de procedencia de la entrega, verbatim: generated by a language model from computed ratios; not a verified fact (true), o rule-based text: no fundamental score (coverage rule); not generated by a model (false)."@es .

:metricGroup a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain skos:Concept ; rdfs:range xsd:string ;
    rdfs:label "Metric group"@en ; rdfs:label "Grupo de métrica"@es ;
    rdfs:comment "One of the ten source metric groups; the 35 loaded concepts cover all ten, with only the three valuation yields and utility_cash_coverage_3y from the otherwise masked valuation/rule-input groups."@en ; rdfs:comment "Uno de los diez grupos de métricas de origen; los 35 conceptos cargados cubren los diez, con solo los tres rendimientos de valoración y utility_cash_coverage_3y de los grupos de valoración y entrada de reglas que por lo demás están enmascarados."@es .

:metricUnit a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ; rdfs:domain skos:Concept ; rdfs:range xsd:string ;
    rdfs:label "Metric unit"@en ; rdfs:label "Unidad de la métrica"@es ;
    rdfs:comment "ratio, x or usd; the 35 loaded metric concepts use ratio or x, and only ebitda and nopat use usd."@en ; rdfs:comment "ratio, x o usd; los 35 conceptos de métricas cargados usan ratio o x, y solo ebitda y nopat usan usd."@es .
